INSERT INTO `mail` VALUES ('0862e720-6705-11f1-a09a-8107a00d61c0','6cfda4ec-6646-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Placeholder draft message body.','approved-draft-placeholder','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('0cbf0185-666b-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','db59d672-6655-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,' \n\nLive Session: Starting in 30 Minutes!\n\nINDIA RUNS Hiring Challenge\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/banner%20(2).png]\nhttps://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Findia_runs%2Fdashboard%2Froadmap%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage/1/0108019ebc284a11-c8c2c1e3-2d05-43fc-a793-c82927b3645e-000000/BKLoDRzGYXQ8RftHfTEjhH0FssI=258\n\nHey Yashica Lohar,\n\n⏱️ We are going live in exactly 30 minutes!\n\nWhen you are looking for your dream job, your resume needs to show exactly what\nyou are capable of. The good news? You can now use AI as your personal career\ncoach to build a resume that gets you noticed instantly.\n\nAs a part of the INDIA RUNS\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Findia_runs%2Fdashboard%2Finteractions%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage/1/0108019ebc284a11-c8c2c1e3-2d05-43fc-a793-c82927b3645e-000000/LArT69uQY3mjS2kENHznvbRcNWY=258]\nmovement, we are hosting an exclusive, live masterclass to show you how to\neasily level up your resume using smart AI tools!\n\nCLICK HERE TO JOIN THE LIVE MASTERCLASS NOW  ➔\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Findia_runs%2Fdashboard%2Finteractions%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage/2/0108019ebc284a11-c8c2c1e3-2d05-43fc-a793-c82927b3645e-000000/5kTAnXg6Czx51p8SgeQ11R6PetU=258]\n\n🚨 LIVE STREAM DETAILS:\n\nStatus: Starting in 30 mins (8:00 PM) Date: Today, 12 June 2026 Access: 100%\nFree for all registered INDIA RUNS profiles\n\n💡 What we will cover in this live session:\n * The AI Resume Upgrade: How to use tools like Redrob AI to turn basic bullet\n   points into high-impact sentences that highlight your actual skills.\n * Matching the Perfect Job: Simple prompts to help you align your resume\n   perfectly with any job description you are targeting.\n * Showcasing Your Projects: How to talk about hands-on projects (like your\n   INDIA RUNS challenge submission) so hiring managers see your value on day\n   one.\n\nWhether you are applying for your first role or sharpening your current profile,\nthis session will give you practical, easy-to-use tips to build a standout\ncareer portfolio.\n\nThe stream room is opening up, so grab your virtual seat right now and let\'s\nsupercharge your resume!\n\nENTER THE WEBINAR ROOM HERE  ➔\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Findia_runs%2Fdashboard%2Finteractions%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage/3/0108019ebc284a11-c8c2c1e3-2d05-43fc-a793-c82927b3645e-000000/4a77AF_FEkOkFTwL3hFAyWO7Ya8=258]\n\n \n\nBest Regards,\nTeam Hack2skill\n#IndiaRuns\n\nThis operational message was sent to registered profiles of the INDIA RUNS\ncommunity. All rights reserved © 2026.\n\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/I0/0108019ebc284a11-c8c2c1e3-2d05-43fc-a793-c82927b3645e-000000/VAJjTn9mZRkEVQaXbaSv8U9tDJw=258]\n\n \n\n \n\nFacebook\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_facebook.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019ebc284a11-c8c2c1e3-2d05-43fc-a793-c82927b3645e-000000/498gwu36bBBT1UvPCjwtd8kFoVk=258\nTwitter\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_twitter.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fhack2skill/1/0108019ebc284a11-c8c2c1e3-2d05-43fc-a793-c82927b3645e-000000/1VWPxxk8I8ndYBXSpvpT8XY1tKU=258\nInstagram\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_instagram.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.