0rW4Hj0dW6rMm2RW6V9W2p2sdDrxW8lwXVz7t1ydMW6pKN174DBvnqVbhh4D34DdqYW6Y3CBt5mj0q2W50mwby5NTDxdW1rKQ4F40LKgXW8q-9nv7--W1GW3y3m2Z8WcC5wW1F2rFH7nNYyKVKfkkv2l8vy9W9hFkRg37lr5yW8YzTf83LGqCCW6kDbhH5PrTbxW1Q9kQ_1S3ypXW5rkDlh2QP-sJW75QM606F6jy2W1SJ4cp4W329nW3czn7y82MkdTW4NmN5T8jw457W8bBN4h1SZG6VV504Hn3Fq2tHW2F2Y5F7CfvlrW3bXFVN1_cdcgW9kMbNZ7s_hDxVgR6Pv8HpQk_W6QrPB_32MqnpW4xthvP1Y6NNzV6s3cR6-GXKwVW-3T97b-pf8Vm30RG1M8QvHW195QLm2K7DS7V-x_Ty1P1vDqW8tyS0G41975xN6dN3z_9bNNGf4P2rqj04 )\n\nroadmap.sh (https://updates.roadmap.sh/e3t/Ctc/L2+113/d5qLSh04/VVvtS265PxTQW8CQ-rN7PkfvcW3LfLlX5QdL9CN3Bm-7d3gP0xW69sMD-6lZ3pxW2TBGlk6JyT5nW8ryFW-7t8x7xW8RrGbQ1hTnM7W4K8N2475ks1fMCY18-8B6TSW60pV7y2cQ5b0W9k36-w3J4bJtW2ddc-83dxsXmW7fZGHy8mh35mW1V92QB2qHmnxW36Frwm8jCq7pW28mP8p6r0y5cN7dDbfHhfzmMW6mYlM-6JVDqmW3N1hwX5vNjxKN8G0pdqQRs-CW17q4HR5Vyp-BW1P0tJP1QW5nHW3QDW8-5ylZ5fW2yVsLZ79mFPMf3RbDFC04 )\n\ngitlab (https://updates.roadmap.sh/e3t/Ctc/L2+113/d5qLSh04/VVvtS265PxTQW8CQ-rN7PkfvcW3LfLlX5QdL9CN3Bm-7R3prCCW7lCdLW6lZ3kWW8nnyW04R30J0W8sQDk81TN39NW1r2VW48hwyCQW6fcXT09bl9k1N8HGxjTVNvdLW6lg0006GqQL9VvwHFV60Xp15W605cVX1qZz3MW4rnXz128cx6WW5TR3-_3-0XtxVK3Z3F3-hpJnW93-fLB6zPSD3W4H1B-w3bdPWqW5F3gqC1rpz53W7ztqfL7t2L-FW3cpLsj51JYmrW75ZLZ17qpCHSW2D-Wcx2WXcwMW63ZcTq1pDVMSW3FdjSc3RkTXDVhfwXc1-4Nb-W3SHPKY6f2_qXW6TgL313g8mFFW8lqYWT2kbF6Rf90K-C004 )\n\nHello Yashica,\n\nKamran here from roadmap.sh. After months of work, we finally launched Lesson Packs (https://updates.roadmap.sh/e3t/Ctc/L2+113/d5qLSh04/VVvtS265PxTQW8CQ-rN7PkfvcW3LfLlX5QdL9CN3Bm-7d3gP0xW69sMD-6lZ3mFW8F-K9s7Nj_9WW8YgdzL66Bk4XW4PBjrF5Ky2x0W3lMRwJ3D2crVW1WS61Z5QSb7fW2xn-BY1wKWsKW45tBgS8BQ6H6W2y4wR6521h9HW5wYqrc8p9RntW61jW_674VMfcW98X5LY4HhJ-BW746T2r4NLZPgW1YJFtW6KB0H1W2qvfkb1xT8srW8k5k502FP932W16TxVN2Hbr5lW6q641b182K-MW51Kr9M4dV4zqV1lpdb4s-fRtW6gjdRC30nwKVf81kGvW04 ) . This is something we\'ve wanted to build for a long time. The goal is simple: help people learn through our official content instead of endlessly jumping between articles, videos, tutorials, and random tabs.\n\nWe also launched a new Forward Deployed Engineer Roadmap covering one of the most in-demand roles in tech right now. On the content side, we\'ve published new guides covering Claude Code, Cursor, OpenClaw, and more tutorials from our Python series.\n\nRead on to learn more!\n\nTogether with GitLab\n\ngl-orbit-paid-600x300-op2-1560-fy27 (https://updates.roadmap.sh/e3t/Ctc/L2+113/d5qLSh04/VVvtS265PxTQW8CQ-rN7PkfvcW3LfLlX5QdL9CN3Bm-7R3prCCW7lCdLW6lZ3kWW8nnyW04R30J0W8sQDk81TN39NW1r2VW48hwyCQW6fcXT09bl9k1N8HGxjTVNvdLW6lg0006GqQL9VvwHFV60Xp15W605cVX1qZz3MW4rnXz128cx6WW5TR3-_3-0XtxVK3Z3F3-hpJnW93-fLB6zPSD3W4H1B-w3bdPWqW5F3gqC1rpz53W7ztqfL7t2L-FW3cpLsj51JYmrW75ZLZ17qpCHSW2D-Wcx2WXcwMW63ZcTq1pDVMSW3FdjSc3RkTXDVhfwXc1-4Nb-W3SHPKY6f2_qXW6TgL313g8mFFW8lqYWT2kbF6Rf90K-C004 )\n\nReason from the source\n\nMore tools mean more noise.\n\nGitLab Orbit (https://updates.roadmap.sh/e3t/Ctc/L2+113/d5qLSh04/VVvtS265PxTQW8CQ-rN7PkfvcW3LfLlX5QdL9CN3Bm-7R3prCCW7lCdLW6lZ3kWW8nnyW04R30J0W8sQDk81TN39NW1r2VW48hwyCQW6fcXT09bl9k1N8HGxjTVNvdLW6lg0006GqQL9VvwHFV60Xp15W605cVX1qZz3MW4rnXz128cx6WW5TR3-_3-0XtxVK3Z3F3-hpJnW93-fLB6zPSD3W4H1B-w3bdPWqW5F3gqC1rpz53W7ztqfL7t2L-FW3cpLsj51JYmrW75ZLZ17qpCHSW2D-Wcx2WXcwMW63ZcTq1pDVMSW3FdjSc3RkTXDVhfwXc1-4Nb-W3SHPKY6f2_qXW6TgL313g8mFFW8lqYWT2kbF6Rf90K-C004 ) connects code, pipelines, deployments, and security signals into one graph.\n\nAgents are smarter and faster because they reason from the source, not copies of it.\n\nLearn more\n(https://updates.roadmap.sh/e3t/Ctc/L2+113/d5qLSh04/VVvtS265PxTQW8CQ-rN7PkfvcW3LfLlX5QdL9CN3Bm-7R3prCCW7lCdLW6lZ3kWW8nnyW04R30J0W8sQDk81TN39NW1r2VW48hwyCQW6fcXT09bl9k1N8HGxjTVNvdLW6lg0006GqQL9VvwHFV60Xp15W605cVX1qZz3MW4rnXz128cx6WW5TR3-_3-0XtxVK3Z3F3-hpJnW93-fLB6zPSD3W4H1B-w3bdPWqW5F3gqC1rpz53W7ztqfL7t2L-FW3cpLsj51JYmrW75ZLZ17qpCHSW2D-Wcx2WXcwMW63ZcTq1pDVMSW3FdjSc3RkTXDVhfwXc1-4Nb-W3SHPKY6f2_qXW6TgL313g8mFFW8lqYWT2kbF6Rf90K-C004 )\n\nLesson Packs\n\nLesson Packs are our best attempt at creating the learning experience we always wanted.\n\nEach pack consists of short lessons with visual explanations, practical examples, and hands-on projects. Everything is written by our team and designed to build on previous lessons, so you can learn step by step rather than piecing things together yourself. The AI Tutor is also available throughout the lessons whenever you need help, have questions, or get stuck. We\'ve launched three Lesson Packs so far:\n\n- Internet Fundamentals (https://updates.roadmap.sh/e3t/Ctc/L2+113/d5qLSh04/VVvtS265PxTQW8CQ-rN7PkfvcW3LfLlX5QdL9CN3Bm-7x3gP0xW6N1vHY6lZ3p-W2jtQ964wTp5qW3-PdZ73CRp-wW1DmhGP2_DdgCV-5KkC630Q2HW8_Nk_Z3sYXy-W1cHjCX41YRPfW5q4cnC3GBVp7W57TRP84t63LqN33NJJKbPvy4W7hCXkg4d2Z6WW1j3zj08w-nRYW4XrnDC2G0GWHW2YSf5n7sHkDyVFMF4y4HXq0sW43pRLJ6jvsVSW4BS-4L5GqKmkW7zbsJg4rjncWW83ffpQ7Z-_94MZs_jmt7BfDW4Xk07m3l0Vw2V10Yd06x6lJhVyC8q95j75_yf3lrQZb04 )\n- HTML Fundamentals (https://updates.roadmap.sh/e3t/Ctc/L2+113/d5qLSh04/VVvtS265PxTQW8CQ-rN7PkfvcW3LfLlX5QdL9CN3Bm-7d3gP0xW69sMD-6lZ3kPW1t0Lrg2KVh_7W67PCxl2cNthsW6YTZZw3bm15XW2CFRY74Sl5yXW8kh7nr6q3h1PW8pbNWP3CKZ8KW1vdPKL3CNtwPW6mB-bh93Ky1TW6MrJZX252bDpW7PwKSW2W4W3nW4BfV_Z1rmNhVW16SP7S8d00hnW8z7WbH1qSs4QN6BxWDTdtpYrW1gRtKN8QkLtPW4WvCbq2_B9RhW13Plz62Fgwn-VT0VWy8qJkTcW5YMJCw3H0-_CW6shJsk62nW2bf70G5W404 )\n- CSS Fundamentals (https://updates.roadmap.sh/e3t/Ctc/L2+113/d5qLSh04/VVvtS265PxTQW8CQ-rN7PkfvcW3LfLlX5QdL9CN3Bm-7d3gP0xW69sMD-6lZ3p5W6PzQ4R12R4YdW1CnM6J3j8S51W6Yh-L28JWDyGW5_-RlN843VbvVZMjPH1dnjz6F56dnSqrfzNW47s6XV43RNTPW7GD06K47hBHLW21y3Fr9j3v0dW91_b5b81HJBpW8q96z56CJrpxW8bxpjv7pVLV4W3Bw3Dp3XM0bvW1bK88R7Rl-RjW54bZTy4XWCdFW8TJdhh6BjDPWF81dyVvW2hmW7zvnKW1hsj06W4tMF597zXpgBW18Zs9c9ls5cmf6SV8LT04 )\n\nThe goal is to cover the individual topics on different roadmaps through these short, no-fluff, practical, and visual lesson packs. You will be seeing more and more lesson packs added every month. If you are a Pro member (https://updates.roadmap.sh/e3t/Ctc/L2+113/d5qLSh04/VVvtS265PxTQW8CQ-rN7PkfvcW3LfLlX5QdL9CN3Bm-7d3gP0x