 in full and complete the attendance verification form on the digital platform\n\n3. Submit the case assignment \"Solve a Traffic Problem\"\nYour experience is important to us. Please take just 1 minute to complete this anonymous survey, it will help us better understand any challenges you may have faced and improve the program for future learners.\nIf you wish to restart the full Forward program at a later date, please register your interest on the Forward website by clicking here <https://links.mckinsey.com/NDczLVpZRS01MjIAAAGjQgM820JN24v4VDu-6xiYy7Xh27CpV478jCsSUJPbhzVxD33wQbQUjN0m-IiHxWYDQ-A0JXM=>, and we will notify you by email when applications for the new cohort open.\nKind regards,\n\n\nThe McKinsey.org Forward Team\n© McKinsey & Company, Inc. \n 175 Greenwich Street \n New York, NY 10007 \n United States\n\nThis email contains operational information regarding your progress in McKinsey’s Forward Program. By opening our emails or clicking on links you agree to our use of cookies and web tracking technology. For more information on how we use and protect your information, please review our privacy policy <https://www.mckinsey.com/privacy-policy>. If you prefer not to receive future email communications from us, please click here <https://links.mckinsey.com/NDczLVpZRS01MjIAAAGjQgM82wMqxIpxfgry7VEuXBOSrdyz1YdlNo9XvzaUOnz_mSF7yvgGQC61tuaeiQ9Y9YhpBBI=> to unsubscribe from all McKinsey communications. Please note, however, that these emails are transactional in nature and are sent while you remain a participant in the program. Unsubscribing from general commercial communications related to McKinsey’s research, insights, services or events will not automatically exclude you from receiving these operational messages, unless you explicitly request otherwise.\n\nThis email was sent to loharyashica@gmail.com. If you no longer wish to receive these emails you may unsubscribe here: https://pages.mckinsey.com/Unsubscribed.html?mkt_unsubscribe=1&mkt_tok=NDczLVpZRS01MjIAAA