LL,NULL,NULL,'[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/solutionChallenge2026/sc-updated.png]\n\n \n\nDear Yashica Lohar,\n\n\nThe countdown has officially begun! We are rapidly approaching the prototype\nsubmission phase, and we know you are all working tirelessly to bring your ideas\nto life.\n\n\nTo help you take your projects from good to groundbreaking, we are thrilled to\ninvite you to our upcoming technical session: Hands-on Workshop on Google AI\nStudio: Build with AI Workshop 02.\n\n\nThis isn\'t just another lecture—it is a practical, code-first session designed\nspecifically to help you integrate cutting-edge AI into your existing builds\njust in time for submission.\n\n\nSession Details\n\nDate: 17th April, 2026\n\nTime: 6:00 - 6:30 PM IST\n\n\nFollow the steps provided below to join the session:\n\nLogin to the hackathon dashboard\n\nNavigate to the Interactions\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fvision.hack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Fsolution-challenge-2026%2Fdashboard%2Finteractions%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage%26utm_campaign=%26utm_term=%26utm_content=/1/0108019d959fcefd-cc60bf1b-8175-416c-8039-d84186b51567-000000/bFBHmmPGiDkWiSC3-__2y5Q-kpc=255]\nSection!\n\nWatch the session Live\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fvision.hack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Fsolution-challenge-2026%2Fdashboard%2Finteractions%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage%26utm_campaign=%26utm_term=%26utm_content=/2/0108019d959fcefd-cc60bf1b-8175-416c-8039-d84186b51567-000000/L5EZnrwGhNYbHeyGv4LxiR1Tg8Y=255]!\n\n\nWhy to attend the session?\nIf you want your prototype to stand out to the judges and gain real-world\nexposure, leveraging the right tools is critical. Google AI Studio is the\nfastest way to prototype and build with Gemini models.\n\n\n\n * Level-Up Your Prototype: Learn how to seamlessly integrate advanced\n   multimodal capabilities (text, vision, and audio) into your project to give\n   it that \"wow\" factor.\n\n * Industry-Grade Exposure: Building with Google’s latest AI infrastructure not\n   only makes your current prototype more robust but also gives you hands-on\n   experience with the tools top tech companies are using today.\n\n * Live Debugging & Support: Bring your current roadblocks! We will have experts\n   on standby to help you troubleshoot your specific prototype integrations on\n   the spot.\n\n\nDon\'t miss this opportunity to refine your build, leverage world-class AI, and\npush your prototype across the finish line with momentum.\n\nImportant Note: Hack2skill Platform Server Maintenance\n\nThe Hack2skill platform will be undergoing scheduled server upgrade and\nmaintenance during the time mentioned below. During this period, the platform\nwill be completely unavailable.\n\n\nMaintenance Window:\n\nStart: Saturday, April 18 at 10:00 PM IST\n\nEnd: Sunday, April 19 at 5:00 AM IST\n\n\nDuring this window you will not be able to access the hackathon dashboard/any\nsection of the platform or submit your prototype. However, you can resume your\nwork and submit your prototype after the maintenance ends.\n\n\nNo need to worry. Please plan your activities accordingly, and you can continue\nright where you left off once the platform is live again.\n\n\nWe appreciate your patience and understanding.\n\n\nRegards,\n\nTeam Hack2skill\n\n \n\n \n\nFacebook\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_facebook.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019d959fcefd-cc60bf1b-8175-416c-8039-d84186b51567-000000/LCC_H4tRwOdFQLnrw9Tw6FeGdBw=255\nTwitter\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_twitter.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fhack2skill/1/0108019d959fcefd-cc60bf1b-8175-416c-8039-d84186b51567-000000/WmUBX4oNJ_gWJCRCTX1FegclXkU=255\nInstagram\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_instagram.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.a