ko tool designed for how you work.\n\n\n\n\nIntroducing CoinGecko\'s Demo API Keyed Plan [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/0cdf2936-2664-4eec-8e22-47bc9e8bb7ca.png]\nQuery crypto data with natural language prompts\n\nConnect CoinGecko to your favorite AI tools using our official Model Context Protocol server. Ask questions like\"What are the top trending tokens on Solana?\"and get structured, real-time answers powered by CoinGecko API.\n\n\nNo code needed. Free to start with our public remote server.\n\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/4798401a-dfff-40d6-bbe8-0e184611c200.gif]\n\n\nSet Up MCP Server [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9Oy&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hQJw4O8&]\n\n\n\n\nIntroducing CoinGecko\'s Demo API Keyed Plan [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/11fb94b0-74e8-471f-b551-8ed70b302f17.png]\nToken-efficient crypto data access in terminal\n\nA fast, open-source terminal interface for the CoinGecko API. Have your AI coding agent install it, and it instantly gains access to live prices, historical OHLC data, market rankings, and more, right from the command line.\n\n\nFor large data tasks, the CLI is up to200x more token-efficientthan repeated MCP calls, saving LLM token costs on every bulk query.\n\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/d9617f22-4863-4b8d-bb80-f7fea4d2f46c.gif]\n\n\nInstall the CLI [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9Oc&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hhXArII&]\n\n\n\nIntroducing CoinGecko\'s Demo API Keyed Plan [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/2c8c7bf6-594c-4807-82e3-50095da7cc21.png]\nPay-per-use crypto data access without an API key\n\nAI agents can query CoinGecko API and pay per request using USDC on Base or Solana. No API key, no subscription required. Each request costs just$0.01 USDC.\n\n\nIdeal for open-source projects, agent experimentation, and autonomous workflows.\n\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/b55f3793-9221-4013-8e0b-56e730f28f0c.gif]\n\n\nLearn About x402 [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9OF&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hyOgpbM&]\n\n\n\nIntroducing CoinGecko\'s Demo API Keyed Plan [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/d9986a79-1f4c-4372-9338-f5b96b43923f.png]\nBuilt-in API knowledge for AI coding agents\n\nAn installable, open-source package that gives any AI coding agent built-in knowledge of80+ CoinGecko API endpoints, schemas, and best practices.\n\n\nGo from natural language prompt to production-ready code in minutes. The Skill also knows which endpoints your API plan unlocks, helping you maximize your integration.\n\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/a6c0ff32-ed2c-420b-ae74-eb00f27e3ad0.gif]\n\n\nInstall Agent Skill [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9Or&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hnOYCJ0&]\n\n\nThe Complete AI-Native Crypto Data Stack\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/ab13773c-f16b-4b45-85d9-51a9800b746b.png]\nEach tool serves a different part of the AI workflow:\n * MCPfor research and natural language queries\n   \n * CLIfor bulk data and terminal-based workflows\n   \n * x402for pay-per-use agent access without an API key\n   \n * Agent Skillfor building production-ready apps with AI coding agents\n   \n\nThis makes CoinGecko API the most complete AI-native crypto data stack, built for every way you work with AI today.\n\n\n\nStart Building With AI [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9OP&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hyLlco&]\n\n\nGet Started for Free\n\nAll four tools work with your existing Demo API key. Explore ourAI Agent Hub documentation [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9O2&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hPTo3g3&]to learn how to set them up for your use case.\n\n\nWant higher rate limits and access to exclusive endpoints?Upgrade to a paid API plan to unlock the full potential of every tool in the stack.\n\n\n\nView API Plans [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9OC&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hnZxPVb&]\n\n\nNeed help? Submit a ticket here [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9O4&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hFaLc5v&].\n\n\n\n\nTrack Crypto Prices 24/7\n\n\n\n\nDownload the CoinGecko Mobile App on Google Play [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/e272be49-7a74-40ad-9119-e87988d906eb.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9ON&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hr6yygL&]\n\n\nDownload the CoinGecko Mobile App on App Store [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/e530caa0-f86d-4621-9c25-428665e3a168.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9OJ&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hs68PtQ&]\n\n\n\n\n\nVisit our Twitter page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/twitter4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9OO&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hrfqy6W&]\n\nVisit our Instagram page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/instagram4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9OR&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hytq3Bp&]\n\nVisit our YouTube page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/youtube4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9Ol&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hFQsIx&]\n\nVisit our Telegram page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/telegram4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9OM&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hQTin2y&]\n\nVisit our Facebook page [ht