9df446fbbb27ddd821000ad&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: Why didn\'t Ram and Sita have any children during the 14 year exile period? Has any explanation been offered in Ramayana?\n\n\nAnswer from Saisha\n\n\nShri Ram was exiled and Mata Sita along with Laxman followed him to the forest. The reason they didn\'t have any children is very simple. Shri Ram was sent to live as an as \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjIxNzU0NDg2ODQ5MTk4NTg0NDN8M3wxfDE0Nzc3NDM5MDIzNzQyMDcifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=ze1sl3WPObd&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=3&et=2&id=79523baa79df446fbbb27ddd821000ad&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: Why are engineering graduates unemployed?\n\n\nAnswer from Paras Tyagi\n\n\nA girl who was my neighbour in Delhi had left for Bangalore as she was placed there after completing her B.Tech from a mediocre college.\n\nOnce I found her father crying in \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjIxNzU0NDg2ODQ5MTk4NTg0NDN8NHwxfDMwNzI1Nzc3MiJ9&al_pri=8&aoid=qN5fiVtFGrB&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=4&et=2&id=79523baa79df446fbbb27ddd821000ad&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\n\n\nJEE RESULT OUT\nCongratulations to all who got their desired rank and percentile ❤️❤️.Your hardwork and discipline finally paid off. AND to all who couldn\'t get their desired rank keep working hard April...\n\n\n\nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjIxNzU0NDg2ODQ5MTk4NTg0NDN8NXwxMHwyNDMyMzgwMDUifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=dzwWb7BTLy8&aoty=4&aty=4&cp=5&et=2&id=79523baa79df446fbbb27ddd821000ad&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n\n-----\nQuestion: How much you saved by age 33?\n\n\nAnswer from Castle Clash\n\n\nI’m 33 year old, Almost reaching 34.\n\nLiving with wife, son and parents.\n\nHere is my savings breakup.\n\nDebt - none (Planning for home loan of around 75L in next couple of  \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjIxNzU0NDg2ODQ5MTk4NTg0NDN8NnwxfDE0Nzc3NDM5MDMwNjM5NDgifQ%3D%3D&al_