 lakhs in Mutual fund and 2 lakhs in stocks since my decision was torn between FD and Stocks. The spe \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE4NjIxMDkxOTIyNzY3OTM2MzV8M3wxfDE0Nzc3NDM4OTUxNTcyMzAifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=mQFYzvRjQUx&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=3&et=2&id=8ab5a4c5c8b74d0e8e6c409d3602cc5a&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: Why didn\'t Ram and Sita have any children during the 14 year exile period? Has any explanation been offered in Ramayana?\n\n\nAnswer from Saisha\n\n\nShri Ram was exiled and Mata Sita along with Laxman followed him to the forest. The reason they didn\'t have any children is very simple. Shri Ram was sent to live as an as \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE4NjIxMDkxOTIyNzY3OTM2MzV8NHwxfDE0Nzc3NDM5MDIzNzQyMDcifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=ze1sl3WPObd&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=4&et=2&id=8ab5a4c5c8b74d0e8e6c409d3602cc5a&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\n\n\nhiiiiii \nso i got 36 percentile in first attempt and 8 percentile in second attempt i never wanted to give jee but i gave because of my parents pressure and just because of that pressure i solved a lo...\n\n\n\nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE4NjIxMDkxOTIyNzY3OTM2MzV8NXwxMHwxNjE3NDIwNjUifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=muz0ZgAssYA&aoty=4&aty=4&cp=5&et=2&id=8ab5a4c5c8b74d0e8e6c409d3602cc5a&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n\n-----\nQuestion: Have you ever accidentally worn transparent or see through clothing?\n\n\nAnswer from Dorna Loone\n\n\nI was at home doing normal domestic duties - but never realized the dress I was wearing could be very transparent if the light came a particular way. My husband was WFH th \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE4NjIxMDkxOTIyNzY3OTM2MzV8NnwxfDE0Nzc3NDM5MDIxNjMyNzQifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=4DH5EZGkm3i&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=6&et=2&id=8ab5a4c5c8b74d0e8e6c409d3602cc5a&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: Why is TCS (Tata Consultancy Services) firing 12,000 Employees (27th July 2025)?\n\n\nAnswer from Shaunak Bhattacharjeee\n\n\nTCS recently announced that it will be terminating the services of 12,000 employees, which is roughly 2% of its global workforce. These layoffs will be targeted towards th \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE4NjIxMDkxOTIyNzY3OTM2MzV8N3wxfDE0Nzc3NDM4NzAxOTQzODkifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=YVsLIQI9Esr&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=7&et=2&id=8ab5a4c5c8b74d0e8e6c409d3602cc5a&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: Is the 6.84 LPA salary in Kolkata too low for a 32-year-old software engineer?\n\n\nAnswer from Anand Mishra\n\n\nSeriously who hired you with this package when you don’t even know if you will be able to survive with this amount.\n\nTrust me, it is very low that too be in Kolkata. You w \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE4NjIxMDkxOTIyNzY3OTM2MzV8OHwxfDI1NzQ3NjAzOSJ9&al_pri=8&aoid=LMpY4gUXhCq&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=8&et=2&id=8ab5a4c5c8b74d0e8e6c409d3602cc5a&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\n\n\n1. Aries - April2026 - Opportunity\n2. Taurus - April2026 - Excitement\n3. Gemini - April2026 - Responsibility\n4. Cancer - April2026 - Obstacles\n5. Leo - April2026 - Powerful\n6. Virgo - April2026 - Wish...\n\n\n\nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE4NjIxMDkxOTIyNzY3OTM2MzV8OXwxMHwyNDU0MTUyMzMifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=zJy3RojXbux&aoty=4&aty=4&cp=9&et=2&id=8ab5a4c5c8b74d0e8e6c409d3602cc5a&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n\n-----\nQuestion: Why can\'t I tell my deceased father\'s bank that he died?\n\n\nAnswer from Daniel Buttafuoco\n\n\nEvery estate lawyer will tell you to NOT advise the bank that your relative (spouse , parent, child, whomever) with whom you share an account died.\n\nWhy? Because that acco \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE4NjIxMDkxOTIyNzY3OTM2MzV8MTB8MXwxNDc3NzQzODg1MTQ4NDkyIn0%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=40qK0juilhF&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=10&et=2&id=8ab5a4c5c8b74d0e8e6c409d3602cc5a&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: Why can India never be as great as Pakistan?\n\n\nAnswer from Start Sameer\n\n\nAs a Bangladeshi living in Finland for over 8 years, I must say India and Pakistan are like apples and oranges (except when it comes to certain aspects like terrorism and  \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE4NjIxMDkxOTIyNzY3OTM2MzV8MTF8MXwxNDc3NzQzNjc2MjI0NTYyIn0%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=FpqvVysjYl4&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=11&et=2&id=8ab5a4c5c8b74d0e8e6c409d3602cc5a&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: My urine has been quite foamy. Does it mean that my kidneys are damaged?\n\n\nAnswer from Pooch Hooch\n\n\nFor 3–4 months I was noticing my urine foaming up. Imagine detergent in water foaming and frothing, that kind. I was terrified. I had my acr done =21. dipstick and culture \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE4NjIxMDkxOTIyNzY3OTM2MzV8MTJ8MXwxNDc3NzQzODk4NzYwNjY5In0%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=oXetc3cXWsq&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=12&et=2&id=8ab5a4c5c8b74d0e8e6c409d3602cc5a&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\n\n-----\n\nTo control which emails we send you, visit: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?aoid&aoty=14&aty=4&cp=0&et=2&id=8ab5a4c5c8b74d0e8e6c409d3602cc5a&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n\nTo unsubscribe from this type of email, visit: https://www.quora.com/email_optout/qemail_unsubscribe?email_track_id=8ab5a4c5c8b74d0e8e6c409d3602cc5a&t=1776742080485787&token=e745bc51c08f926038effc8bad63a8c4a0902e1dec82cd8b00a50b26dd422aea2cb88fea172fdd6c6ab32a26b756ee812e733e2442255612189674dc442cbac7&type=2&uid=1952091097','incoming-complaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a52281ce-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dear Quora Digest,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"How is life at IITs?\".\n\nYour reference ID is #d69e6b3d. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','IN