ml-email_m2m_invite_single_01-help-0-textfooterglimmer-null-icq8ji~mo93pun9~dr-null-null&eid=icq8ji-mo93pun9-dr&otpToken=MTMwNDFlZTkxNTI5YzljMmJjMjgwZmViNDExOWUxYmM4ZmNhZDg0MzlmYTY4YTZmN2JjZjA1Njc0NzU5NTRmYmYwZDBkM2U5NGFmNmUzODM0NmFjZTljYmEzOGI2NjI3MWI3NTU5ZWIxOTc0YThkNDM0YWFhYTdmLDEsMQ%3D%3D\n\n© 2026 LinkedIn Corporation, 1zwnj000 West Maude Avenue, Sunnyvale, CA 94085.\nLinkedIn and the LinkedIn logo are registered trademarks of LinkedIn.','incoming-complaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a545f4b6-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dear Abhinay Dubey,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"You have an invitation ✉️\".\n\nYour reference ID is #d69e6b3d. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a54b16d9-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Kaggle\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHi Yashica Lohar,\n\nLast November, we launched our first 5-Day AI Agents Intensive Course with Google, reaching over 1.5 million learners. By popular demand, we\'re excited to bring it back—now with updated content, new speakers, and a hands-on capstone project, all at no cost to registrants.\n\nIt\'s a 5-day intensive online course from June 15–19 designed to help users learn how to build, evaluate, and deploy powerful AI agents using vibecoding workflows, tools, APIs, and multi-agent systems from foundational concepts to production-ready applications. We will also explore how natural language serves as the new programming interface for building autonomous agents.\n\n\n\n\n\nRegister for the Course\n\n\n\nEveryday, participants will receive the following information:\n\n\n📚 Daily Assignments: This includes the whitepapers, a companion podcast and companion codelabs that you can complete at your own pace.\n\n💬 Discord Discussion: Kaggle\'s Discord server will have a dedicated channel for focused discussion during the event. It\'s an excellent place to find further clarification, surface any questions, and connect with other learners and Google experts.\n\n🎥 Daily Livestreams and AMAs: We will go live everyday on Kaggle\'s YouTube channel, where the authors and course contributors will dive deeper into the topics and answer your questions. Plus, we\'ve got fun surprises in store to keep the learning engaging.\n\n💻 Capstone project: Level up your skills and strengthen your portfolio with a real-world capstone project. At the end of the 5-day course, you\'ll have the opportunity to participate and compete for prizes such as Kaggle certificates, badges, swag, and recognition across Kaggle and Google\'s social media channels. Participation will be optional - you\'ll learn more about the capstone project during the course.\n\n\nFor more information, visit the event website. Hope to see you there!\n\nThe Kaggle Team\n\n\n\nKaggle, Inc 1600 Amphitheatre Pkwy Mountain View, CA 94043\n\nThis email was sent to loharyashica@gmail.com because you indicated that you\'d like to receive news and updates about Kaggle. If you don\'t want to receive these emails in the future, please unsubscribe here. You can also change your preferences on your account\'s profile page by logging in at kaggle.com.\n\n\n\n','incoming-complaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a54bb320-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dear Kaggle,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"Register for 5-Day AI Agents: Intensive Vibe Coding Course with Google\".\n\nYour reference ID is #d69e6b3d. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a5681c40-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Top stories for Yashica\n\n-----\n\n\n\n1. Aries - April2026 - Opportunity\n2. Taurus - April2026 - Excitement\n3. Gemini - April2026 - Responsibility\n4. Cancer - April2026 - Obstacles\n5. Leo - April2026 - Powerful\n6. Virgo - April2026 - Wish...\n\n\n\nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjIxMzk5ODUyODA5MzczOTQwMTR8MXwxMHwyNDU0MTUyMzMifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=zJy3RojXbux&aoty=4&aty=4&cp=1&et=2&id=edf6e8751ccb4d5ab4876120698bb45b&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n\n-----\nQuestion: Is vitamin B12 high in any fruit?\n\n\nAnswer from Johnson Washbourne\n\n\nThe question with an answer that nobody wants to hear. And the truth that makes it even more important.\n\nNo. Not a single fruit contains any meaningful amount of vitamin B \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjIxMzk5ODUyODA5MzczOTQwMTR8MnwxfDE0Nzc3NDM5MDE1NzgzOTUifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=IKMArtQ8mId&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=2&et=2&id=edf6e8751ccb4d5ab4876120698bb45b&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: How is IISc viewed by IITians?\n\n\nAnswer from Kalyan Ram\n\n\nWhen I got into IISc and leaving my job to join, I heard the following from my colleagues both IITians\n\n * You are going to the right place, you will enjoy the research an \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjIxMzk5ODUyODA5MzczOTQwMTR8M3wxfDQxMjU5MzY3In0%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=alYjrYDMUw2&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=3&et=2&id=edf6e8751ccb4d5ab4876120698bb45b&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: Why is TCS (Tata Consultancy Services) firing 12,000 Employees (27th July 2025)?\n\n\nAnswer from Shaunak Bhattacharjeee\n\n\nTCS recently announced that it will be terminating the services of 12,000 employees, which is roughly 2% of its global workforce. These layoffs will be targeted towards th \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjIxMzk5ODUyODA5MzczOTQwMTR8NHwxfDE0Nzc3NDM4NzAxOTQzODkifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=YVsLIQI9Esr&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=4&et=2&id=edf6e8751ccb4d5ab4876120698bb45b&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\n\n\nI am 32 year old ,My monthly salary is 90k\nI have a personal loan emi 30k which gone end in Feb 2027. My sip is 15k in mutual fund, 5.3lacs in stocks ,4 lacs in mutual fund, 14 lacs in NPS ,no emergen...\n\n\n\nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjIxMzk5ODUyODA5MzczOTQwMTR8NXwxMHwyMzIyODgwNTUifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=FczwaNSkjnU&aoty=4&aty=4&cp=5&et=2&id=edf6e8751ccb4d5ab4876120698bb45b&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n\n-----\nQuestion: How and why did you leave your job in IOCL?\n\n\nAnswer from Akanksha Mittal\n\n\n23rd Dec 2025, My last day at IOCL.\n\nI resigned from IOCL after working there for more than 11 years.\n\nLanding a job in Indian Oil Corporation Limited was a dream come tru \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjIxMzk5ODUyODA5MzczOTQwMTR8NnwxfDE0Nzc3NDM5MDQ3MTgxNjcifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=9stvx70Osru&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=6&et=2&id=edf6e8751ccb4d5ab4876120698bb45b&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: मृत्यु के पश्चात मनुष्य के साथ मनुष्य की पाँच वस्तुएँ साथ जाती हैं?\n\n\nAsked in Yoga With Bijay, Answer from Bijay Jha\n\n\n1-(कामना )-यदि मृत्य के समय हमारे मन मे किसी वस्तु विशेष के प्रति कोई आसक्ति शेष रह जाती है ।कोई इक्षा अधूरी रह जाती है।कोई अपूर्ण कामना रह जाती है।तो मरणोपरांत भी वही काम \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjIxMzk5ODUyODA5MzczOTQwMTR8N3wxfDE0Nzc3NDM4MzU4MDQzNjIifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=LULONkoplG7&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=7&et=2&id=edf6e8751ccb4d5ab4876120698bb45b&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: Why can\'t I tell my deceased father\'s bank that he died?\n\n\nAnswer from Daniel Buttafuoco\n\n\nEvery estate lawyer will tell you to NOT advise the bank that your relative (spouse , parent, child, whomever) with whom you share an account died.\n\nWhy? Because that acco \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjIxMzk5ODUyODA5MzczOTQwMTR8OHwxfDE0Nzc3NDM4ODUxNDg0OTIifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=40qK0juilhF&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=8&et=2&id=edf6e8751ccb4d5ab4876120698bb45b&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\n\n\nAfter the breakup, we didn’t delete each other, but we didn’t contact each other again. One day, he posted a photo with his new girlfriend on TikTok. The moment I saw it, I felt sad and tears came to ...\n\n\n\nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjIxMzk5ODUyODA5MzczOTQwMTR8OXwxMHwyMjY3NjE3MzcifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=uQxhjd3cn7&aoty=4&aty=4&cp=9&et=2&id=edf6e8751ccb4d5ab4876120698bb45b&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n\n-----\nQuestion: My urine has been quite foamy. Does it mean that my kidneys are damaged?\n\n\nAnswer from Pooch Hooch\n\n\nFor 3–4 months I was noticing my urine foaming up. Imagine detergent in water foaming and frothing, that kind. I was terrified. I had my acr done =21. dipstick and culture \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjIxMzk5ODUyODA5MzczOTQwMTR8MTB8MXwxNDc3NzQzODk4NzYwNjY5In0%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=oXetc3cXWsq&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=10&et=2&id=edf6e8751ccb4d5ab4876120698bb45b&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: Is the 6.84 LPA salary in Kolkata too low for a 32-year-old software engineer?\n\n\nAnswer from Anand Mishra\n\n\nSeriously who hired you with this package when you don’t even know if you will be able to survive with this amount.\n\nTrust me, it is very low that too be in Kolkata. You w \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjIxMzk5ODUyODA5MzczOTQwMTR8MTF8MXwyNTc0NzYwMzkifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=LMpY4gUXhCq&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=11&et=2&id=edf6e8751ccb4d5ab4876120698bb45b&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: I was cheating on my husband of 18 years with his own friend and after 2 years, my husband caught me. How can I make this go away from his mind and have him forgive me and move forward?\n\n\nAsked in The Betrayed Spouse\'s Space and Community, Answer from Robert Yunk\n\n\nThere is only one possible thing you can do to make this go away from his mind. And even with this one thing, there are no guarantees.\n\nThe one thing you can do to help ma \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjIxMzk5ODUyODA5MzczOTQwMTR8MTJ8MXwxNDc3NzQzODk5NzA3NDcxIn0%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=4uWBBQHKrY1&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=12&et=2&id=edf6e8751ccb4d5ab4876120698bb45b&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\n\n-----\n\nTo control which emails we send you, visit: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?aoid&aoty=14&aty=4&cp=0&et=2&id=edf6e8751ccb4d5ab4876120698bb45b&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n\nTo unsubscribe from this type of email, visit: https://www.quora.com/email_optout/qemail_unsubscribe?email_track_id=edf6e8751ccb4d5ab4876120698bb45b&t=1776828455718873&token=384a2d5fb86d11bd93bba50d1f4c39ef3631977989628e487af3d37d7415d094e4f0679b873a2989d158472d8289880fb06080a4a270bd7f6c2dc372ba5b169d&type=2&uid=1952091097','incoming-complaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a568cb5c-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dear Quora Digest,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"1. Aries - April2026 - Opportunity 2. Taurus - April2026 - Excitement 3. Gemini - Apri...\".\n\nYour reference ID is #d69e6b3d. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a57a986a-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,' \n\nSolution Challenge 2026\nBanner\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/solutionChallenge2026/sc-7day.png] Hi\nInnovator,\n\nIt\'s time to show the world what you\'ve built.\n\nWe are officially 7 days away from the Solution Challenge 2026 deadline. This is\nyour moment to move from idea to execution, submit your prototype, and refine it\nas you go. Don’t wait for perfection—ship what you have, improve it, and make an\nimpact.\n\nNote: It is mandatory to use the given presentation template for project\nsubmission: Download now →\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fpresentation%2Fd%2F1xiWuM0vqqjPUR-eAR4PIzu_CaLucYEJfLZOE8GXYyjo%2Fexport%2Fpptx/1/0108019db4130ebd-ca777897-d031-4471-8eef-85217b5fba74-000000/pFR3C1ypn4jZz6ZWwCSQUQ0h2OQ=256]\nSubmission Requirements\n1\nProblem Statement\n\nClearly define the issue your team is addressing.\n\n2\nSolution Overview\n\nExplain how your prototype solves the problem.\n\n3\nPrototype Link\n\nA live MVP link demonstrating core functionality.\n\n4\nProject Deck\n\nDetailing your solution, architecture, and impact.\n\n5\nGitHub Repository\n\nPublic link to your well-structured source code.\n\n6\nDemo Video\n\nA short video showcasing your solution in action.\n\nClick Here to Submit Your Prototype\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Fsolution-challenge-2026%2Fregistration%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage%26utm_campaign=%26utm_term=%26utm_content=/1/0108019db4130ebd-ca777897-d031-4471-8eef-85217b5fba74-000000/XD7LpabqBXmoKZxMItAhJC05qsI=256]\n\n\nYOUR TREASURE MAP TO SUBMISSION\n\nTo help you cross the finish line, we’ve put together a beginner-friendly 6-step\nguide with practical prompts to jumpstart your submission.\n\nClick Here for the Guide\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fdocument%2Fd%2F1nBtrGqdJWuIOOMAVkw3rfKohoaTMl8UyOYf4QB3qADs%2Fedit%3Ftab=t.0%23heading=h.r62xehm9jalv/1/0108019db4130ebd-ca777897-d031-4471-8eef-85217b5fba74-000000/WR1AMVj9MMQg4W4klWSzGK9wVCs=256]\n\nStart gathering your materials now!\n\nRegards,\nTeam Hack2skill\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/I0/0108019db4130ebd-ca777897-d031-4471-8eef-85217b5fba74-000000/rDyxp1O8eqTgSiOcSQ3xRZLtAGE=256]\n\n \n\n \n\nFacebook\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_facebook.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019db4130ebd-c