mplaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a57b27a5-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dear Solution Challenge 2026 - Build with AI,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"⏳ 7 Days to Go: Your Prototype Submission Guide\".\n\nYour reference ID is #d69e6b3d. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a58376da-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/sc-gemma.png]\n\n \n\nDear Yashica Lohar,\n\n\nThis is a gentle reminder that the hands-on workshop on “Introduction to Gemma:\nBuild with AI Workshop 03” is happening today! \n\n\nBy joining this session, you will understand:\n\n * About the Gemma 4 Model \n\n * Hands-on live building \n\n * Tips to integrate Gemma into your prototypes \n\n * Live FAQ to solve your queries\n   \n   \n\nSession Details \n\nTODAY!\nTime: 6:00 - 6:30 PM IST\n\n\nHow to join the session?\n\nHackathon Dashboard\n\nInteractions\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fvision.hack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Fsolution-challenge-2026%2Fdashboard%2Finteractions%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage/1/0108019db41e9667-de97bf38-380d-46a0-aa8a-8c355b1deb79-000000/P8926rCtUgZt-zaBqVDi4rwA2eg=256]\nSection \n\nWatch it LIVE\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fvision.hack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Fsolution-challenge-2026%2Fdashboard%2Finteractions%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage/2/0108019db41e9667-de97bf38-380d-46a0-aa8a-8c355b1deb79-000000/knqxjVBopRCTgR1aq3-su2hDZiU=256]!\n\n\nAs we are approaching the final days of the hackathon and the prototype\nsubmissions deadline is also coming to an end. We’ve created a simple 6-step,\nbeginner-friendly guide with practical prompts to help you get started-even if\nyou’re starting today.\n\n\nClick Here for the Treasure Guide\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fdocument%2Fd%2F1nBtrGqdJWuIOOMAVkw3rfKohoaTMl8UyOYf4QB3qADs%2Fedit%3Fusp=sharing/1/0108019db41e9667-de97bf38-380d-46a0-aa8a-8c355b1deb79-000000/69pXT_6eiPJv04CSDePqkQslJfQ=256]\n\n\nSee you at the session!\n\n\nRegards,\n\nTeam Hack2skill \n\n \n\n \n\nFacebook\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_facebook.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019db41e9667-de97bf38-380d-46a0-aa8a-8c355b1deb79-000000/sIr8VdO4ejdt64gVlCSrwxN_aRY=256\nTwitter\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_twitter.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fhack2skill/1/0108019db41e9667-de97bf38-380d-46a0-aa8a-8c355b1deb79-000000/InQsozYLuJfj3rO2PxVNmrw_SUs=256\nInstagram\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_instagram.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019db41e9667-de97bf38-380d-46a0-aa8a-8c355b1deb79-000000/G27Dl5zG0xQDtDFEMFWHyxbVEck=256\nLinkedIn\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_linkedin.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019db41e9667-de97bf38-380d-46a0-aa8a-8c355b1deb79-000000/haChluw8R7qOjmb1gmbQsW3zQaU=256\nYouTube\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_youtube.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fchannel%2FUCw2br80x_dpvJoAsSCC-bGA/1/0108019db41e9667-de97bf38-380d-46a0-aa8a-8c355b1deb79-000000/1LovbuPwJhM9ZPKptvjMJIiVxSQ=256\nWhatsApp\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_whatsapp.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fapi.whatsapp.com%2Fsend%2F%3Fphone=919870330830%26text%26type=phone_number%26app_absent=0/1/0108019db41e9667-de97bf38-380d-46a0