s addressing.\n\n2\nSolution Overview\n\nExplain how your prototype solves the problem.\n\n3\nPrototype Link\n\nA live MVP link demonstrating core functionality.\n\n4\nProject Deck\n\nDetailing your solution, architecture, and impact.\n\n5\nGitHub Repository\n\nPublic link to your well-structured source code.\n\n6\nDemo Video\n\nA short video showcasing your solution in action.\n\nClick Here to Submit Your Prototype\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Fsolution-challenge-2026%2Fregistration%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage%26utm_campaign=%26utm_term=%26utm_content=/1/0108019db8a92874-1c9c5de0-6c13-42d4-a6ec-0db9db943ecd-000000/e0eicvPDCOQWeMU5oWIiXZcKasI=256]\n\n\nYOUR TREASURE MAP TO SUBMISSION\n\nWe’re here to help you succeed, which is why we’ve launched a 6-step guide with\npractical prompts to simplify your journey from an idea to a submitted\nprototype—even on a tight schedule.\n\nClick Here for the Guide\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fdocument%2Fd%2F1nBtrGqdJWuIOOMAVkw3rfKohoaTMl8UyOYf4QB3qADs%2Fedit%3Ftab=t.0%23heading=h.r62xehm9jalv/1/0108019db8a92874-1c9c5de0-6c13-42d4-a6ec-0db9db943ecd-000000/w5CcHGZQ24DwNr2su_QwcjjsSAU=256]\n\nDon\'t wait until the last minute—ensure your slides are ready for review.\n\nRegards,\nTeam Hack2skill\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/I0/0108019db8a92874-1c9c5de0-6c13-42d4-a6ec-0db9db943ecd-000000/HDsxwrQOt7C3wAakKRYYQza1O-4=256]\n\n \n\n \n\nFacebook\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_facebook.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019db8a92874-1c9c5de0-6c13-42d4-a6ec-0db9db943ecd-000000/pJc5VgD62NJNd3wGuILHQ8p4Sp0=256\nTwitter\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_twitter.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fhack2skill/1/0108019db8a92874-1c9c5de0-6c13-42d4-a6e