 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a6028883-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dear WPS Office,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"Welcome to join WPS Office\".\n\nYour reference ID is #d69e6b3d. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a602d782-6d97-11f1-89d5-e86538d58b3c','e754e5ff-6703-11f1-a09a-8107a00d61c0','Earn while helping your juniors crack JEE! 😍','updates@mathongo.com','loharyashica@gmail.com',NULL,'REFER & EARN WITH MATHONGO\n\nHey Yashica Lohar!\n\nI\'m Shivani from MathonGo. Hope college life is treating you well! 😄\n\nQuick one! Your juniors are probably already flooding your DMs asking which test\nseries you used. Well, here\'s your chance to help them out and earn while doing\nit.\n\nWe\'ve just launched our Refer & Earn Program and it\'s pretty straightforward:\n\n * Share your unique referral code with JEE aspirants\n * They get a discount, and you earn every single time someone joins\n * Top referrers have earned ₹50,000+ in a single season\n\nAll the details are on the form. It takes less than a minute to apply and you\'ll\nget your code within 72 hours.\n\nApply Here\n[https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeVRMp_Bae3W72ixDBMtEYzRQib4pz_WyxNAF9lDHccql4Qdw/viewform]\n\nWould love to have you on board!\n\nShivani\nTeam MathonGo\n\n© 2026 MathonGo. All rights reserved.','incoming-complaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 17:35:51',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a604c95e-6d97-11f1-89d5-e86538d58b3c','e754e5ff-6703-11f1-a09a-8107a00d61c0','Re: Earn while helping your juniors crack JEE! 😍','loharyashica@gmail.com','updates@mathongo.com',NULL,'Dear Shivani from MathonGo,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"Earn while helping your juniors crack JEE! 😍\".\n\nYour reference ID is #e754e5ff. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','OUTGOING',NULL,'2026-06-21 17:35:51',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a60a8ffd-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,' \n\nSolution Challenge 2026 - 5 Days Left\n5 Days Left Banner\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/solutionChallenge2026/sc-5day.png] Hi\nYashica Lohar,\n\nWe know how hard you’re working to get every line of code just right. Now that\nyour PPT is taking shape.\n\nFocus on Demo Video Today!\nUse today to record your Prototype Demo Video. Two golden rules for your video:\n• Make it audible: We want to hear your explanation clearly.\n• Make it accessible: Ensure the link is set to \"Public\" so our evaluators can\nview it without hurdles.\n\nClick Here to Submit Your Prototype\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Fsolution-challenge-2026%2Fregistration%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage%26utm_campaign=%26utm_term=%26utm_content=/1/0108019dbdc119ee-48bdb7de-208d-460c-b0f4-875e580828a1-000000/7KEDdxxErlajVJy1rXCuLdkItJ4=256]\nNote: It is mandatory to use the given presentation template for project\nsubmission: Download now →\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fpresentation%2Fd%2F1xiWuM0vqqjPUR-eAR4PIzu_CaLucYEJfLZOE8GXYyjo%2Fexport%2Fpptx/1/0108019dbdc119ee-48bdb7de-208d-460c-b0f4-875e580828a1-000000/80O-MYgeOp5wszC9sO1r_AqhKsk=256]\n\n\nHOW YOUR PROTOTYPE WILL BE EVALUATED:\n\n• Your Prototype Deck will be the first thing to be reviewed.\n\n• Only if your PPT passes, your Video Demo will be reviewed.\n\n• Only if your Demo Video passes, your Prototype will be reviewed.\n\n• Only if all the above passes, your GitHub Repo will be reviewed.\n\nDon’t wait for perfection. If your prototype isn’t fully ready, submit what you\nhave right now with the core features. You can always improve, but you can’t\nsubmit late.\n\nSubmission Requirements\n1\nProblem Statement\n\nClearly define the issue your team is addressing.\n\n2\nSolution Overview\n\nExplain how your prototype solves the problem.\n\n3\nPrototype Link\n\nA live MVP link demonstrating core functionality.\n\n4\nProject Deck\n\nDetailing your solution, architecture, and impact.\n\n5\nGitHub Repository\n\nPublic link to your well-structured source code.\n\n6\nDemo Video\n\nA short video showcasing your solution in action.\n\n\nYOUR TREASURE MAP TO SUBMISSION\n\nMaximize your impact with our simple 6-step roadmap; it’s designed with\neasy-to-follow prompts to ensure you can submit a high-quality prototype, even\nif you’re kicking off today.\n\nClick Here for the Guide\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fdocument%2Fd%2F1nBtrGqdJWuIOOMAVkw3rfKohoaTMl8UyOYf4QB3qADs%2Fedit%3Ftab=t.0%23heading=h.r62xehm9jalv/1/0108019dbdc119ee-48bdb7de-208d-460c-b0f4-875e580828a1-000000/5o3bnKG9f4-nit71m37hNCHDSXE=256]\n\nYou can always update your links as you progress, but submitting what you have\nright now ensures you are in the system and ready for the final count.\n\nRegards,\nTeam Hack2skill\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/I0/0108019dbdc119ee-48bdb7de-208d-460c-b0f4-875e580828a1-000000/AYIIe2htzriqQbz3JYWRtPXsn78=256]\n\n \n\n \n\nFacebook\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_facebook.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019dbdc119ee-48bdb7de-208d-460c-b0f4-875e580828a1-000000/NCwVnr5Z3_I6f0lE_R3Cs7eohGo=256\nTwitter\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_twitter.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fhack2skill/1/0108019dbdc119ee-48bdb7de-208d-460c-b0f4-875e580828a1-000000/ZStoZrDyNdxguo_7Xq1dEal23w0=256\nInstagram\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_instagram.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019dbdc119ee-48bdb7de-208d-460c-b0f4-875e580828a1-000000/