r,\n\nMissed the live AI Resume Masterclass?\n\nNo worries at all! The full session playbook and recording are officially up\ninside the Interaction Section\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Findia_runs%2Fdashboard%2Finteractions%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage/1/0108019ed5eebf3d-b0aa793d-4359-4a5b-863a-30c68c82a617-000000/PWN-56hB3sryILH5TYt2ww0bSSM=258]\nof your dashboard, ready for you to explore whenever you have some free time.\n\nWe\'ve also dropped a quick Challenge Guide\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fdrive.google.com%2Ffile%2Fd%2F18BCCJQtNpun-e0h4Y3xUzxN6y30WT__o%2Fview%3Fusp=drive_link/1/0108019ed5eebf3d-b0aa793d-4359-4a5b-863a-30c68c82a617-000000/OpBUiwSf1ry0vXrV0Y7PoOr98jU=258] to\nhelp you navigate the features smoothly. To make things a bit more exciting as\nyou build, we are running a casual community sprint!\n\n🌐 EXPLORE THE PLATFORM\n\nReady to jump straight into the optimization suite? Use our official link to\naccess Redrob AI for the Mini challenge.\n\nNote: Use this link only to be eligible for the Mini Challenge\n\nLAUNCH REDROB AI ➔\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.redrob.ai%2F%3Futm_source=17Junmail%26utm_medium=H2S/1/0108019ed5eebf3d-b0aa793d-4359-4a5b-863a-30c68c82a617-000000/XhgygLiLXpJYJnw8ilqtAn6sv-M=258]\n\n✨ JOIN THE MINI-CHALLENGE: AI RESUME SPRINT\n\nWant to test out your new profile engineering strategies? Try out the quick\nplayground activities demonstrated during the masterclass on Redrob AI\n[http://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/http:%2F%2Fwww.redrob.ai%2F%3Futm_source=17Junmail%26utm_medium=H2S/1/0108019ed5eebf3d-b0aa793d-4359-4a5b-863a-30c68c82a617-000000/z-nafxVSDF6QTmjWCDazDLwQH4E=258]\nand share your progress.\n\n🚀 ACCEPT THE MINI-CHALLENGE SPRINT\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Findia_runs%2Fdashboard%2Fforms%2F6a32a126c56c84eb938bc2f4%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage/1/0108019ed5eebf3d-b0aa793d-4359-4a5b-863a-30c68c82a617-000000/tfSUoHnc_YoReppC8b_qsLag6zM=258]\n\n🎮 How to Play Along:\n 1. Take a quick look at the masterclass recording on your dashboard.\n 2. Try out any of the features shown in the session directly on Redrob AI.\n    [http://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/http:%2F%2Fwww.redrob.ai%2F%3Futm_source=17Junmail%26utm_medium=H2S/2/0108019ed5eebf3d-b0aa793d-4359-4a5b-863a-30c68c82a617-000000/Os7QkF-pnFXmqogmm2nBOeZHt6M=258]\n 3. Snap a screenshot of your updated space as proof of your activity.\n 4. Drop your screenshot in the sprint submission form on your dashboard to\n    enter the running.\n\n📸 Submission Checklist Tips\n\nTo ensure our evaluation team can review your mini-challenge entry on the\nleaderboard, make sure your image clearly showcases:\n\n * 🔹 Your username visible in the bottom-left area of the Redrob sidebar layout\n * 🔹 The active profile or main workspace dashboard view\n * 🔹 Your personal updates in action, such as:\n\n• Profile progress completion milestones\n• Key technical/growth skills appended\n• Refreshed projects or work history experience blocks\n• Active ecosystem opportunities explored\n\n💡 Note: Our review team relies on these visual anchor points to verify entries\nfor the prize shortlists!\n\n🎁 Prizes: Top submissions will be shortlisted and rewarded with exclusive\nrewards and recognition. ⏰ Timeline: Sunday, 18 June 2026\n11:59 PM IST\n\nThink of it as a low-stakes sandbox to experiment with your profile.\n\nTake a few minutes to play around with the tools, show us what you built, and\nclaim your shot at the rewards pool!\n\n \n\nBest Regards,\nTeam Hack2skill × Redrob AI\n#IndiaRuns\n\nThis operational message was sent to registered profiles of the INDIA RUNS\ncommunity. All rights reserved © 2026.\n\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/I0/0108019ed5eebf3d-b0aa793d-4359-4a5b-863a-30c68c82a617-000000/z40zGGZ