your Demo Video passes, your Prototype will be reviewed.\n\n• Only if all the above submission passes, your GitHub Repo will be reviewed.\n\nSubmission Requirements\n1\nProblem Statement\n\nClearly define the issue your team is addressing.\n\n2\nSolution Overview\n\nExplain how your prototype solves the problem.\n\n3\nPrototype Link\n\nA live MVP link demonstrating core functionality.\n\n4\nProject Deck\n\nDetailing your solution, architecture, and impact.\n\n5\nGitHub Repository\n\nPublic link to your well-structured source code.\n\n6\nDemo Video\n\nA short video showcasing your solution in action.\n\n\nYOUR TREASURE MAP TO SUBMISSION\n\nYou have what it takes to build a solution! We’ve created a practical 6-step\nguide with simple prompts to guide your submission, proving it\'s never too late\nto start.\n\nClick Here for the Guide\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fdocument%2Fd%2F1nBtrGqdJWuIOOMAVkw3rfKohoaTMl8UyOYf4QB3qADs%2Fedit%3Ftab=t.0%23heading=h.r62xehm9jalv/1/0108019dc820a085-8d66ba4a-7a46-4482-8b99-829f82688abc-000000/zgaodKtIkDtDpWYuzFG5B63I6LY=256]\n\nFocus on clearly conveying your idea, not building a fully polished\nsolution—impact matters more than perfection.\n\nRegards,\nTeam Hack2skill\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/I0/0108019dc820a085-8d66ba4a-7a46-4482-8b99-829f82688abc-000000/VcIj4WZzN_L_X11MfSbgLMgBKjg=256]\n\n \n\n \n\nFacebook\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_facebook.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019dc820a085-8d66ba4a-7a46-4482-8b99-829f82688abc-000000/BwM09SfLbe-hkHCVsH1pUHhdgMk=256\nTwitter\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_twitter.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fhack2skill/1/0108019dc820a085-8d66ba4a-7a46-4482-8b99-829f82688abc-000000/vKaTSZ16nLho7mu1gc93rmOX1wM=256\nInstagram\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAss