text-decoration: none; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;\"></a></p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Networking feels fake. Showing up online feels cringe… I have heard it all. The worst part? Putting yourself out there is honestly one of the best ways to create new opportunities.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Join me and Gianluca Russo, the (self-proclaimed) communications king, as we take your answers live and spill the tea on building community — and making the most of LinkedIn. Nothing is off the table. No question is too basic. Chances are someone else is wondering the same thing!</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"ql-cta-button\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/events/7473077495416901633/?campaignId=05c76379-f2fa-4b72-9316-9b3b6eef97ce&emailKey=email_editorial_prompt_single_01&uuid=04e3202c-f3f0-4416-9fbb-5baed4cb588f\" style=\"display: inline-block; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; font-size: 16px; background-color: #0a66c2; padding: 10px; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; color: white !important;\" data-buttontype=\"Primary\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">﻿<span contenteditable=\"false\">Click \'Attend\' &amp; Let\'s Chat</span>﻿</a></p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400; text-align: center;\"><em style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Can\'t join us live? Access the replay by clicking \'Attend\'.</em></p>\n      \n\n----------------------------------------\n\nThis email was intended for Yashica Lohar (Flipkart GWC 7.0 Scholar | CSE ’28 @ IIIT Jabalpur | 2 ⭐ @Codechef)\nLearn why we included this: https://www.linkedin.com/help/linkedin/answer/4788?lang=en&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_editorial_prompt_single_01%3B7P0YxrE%2FQ8WZ%2Fb67i%2F1SuA%3D%3D&midToken=AQG-BFco0wt-tA&midSig=3lL1UY8Shd8Yk1&trk=eml-email_editorial_prompt_single_01-SecurityHelp-0-textfooterglimmer&trkEmail=eml-email_editorial_prompt_single_01-SecurityHelp-0-textfooterglimmer-null-icq8ji~mqjujyk3~4e-null-null&eid=icq8ji-mqjujyk3-4e\nYou are receiving Editorial Outreach emails\n\n\nUnsubscribe: https://www.linkedin.com/comm/mypreferences/u/emailunsub?action=updateEmailSubscription&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_editorial_prompt_single_01%3B7P0YxrE%2FQ8WZ%2Fb67i%2F1SuA%3D%3D&midToken=AQG-BFco0wt-tA&midSig=3lL1UY8Shd8Yk1&trk=eml-email_editorial_prompt_single_01-unsubscribe-0-textfooterglimmer&trkEmail=eml-email_editorial_prompt_single_01-unsubscribe-0-textfooterglimmer-null-icq8ji~mqjujyk3~4e-null-null&eid=icq8ji-mqjujyk3-4e&loid=AQFhz902iOwZUgAAAZ7cMkRe-RsISoKD-1YQdPXnYWOg-vI1ordyku0RQoh02nkdtE46nm8q4TcW5apav115bOqFGaLdmFNFFfX7Asr5zIN4pyEJbA\nHelp: https://www.linkedin.com/help/linkedin/answer/67?lang=en&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_editorial_prompt_single_01%3B7P0YxrE%2FQ8WZ%2Fb67i%2F1SuA%3D%3D&midToken=AQG-BFco0wt-tA&midSig=3lL1UY8Shd8Yk1&trk=eml-email_editorial_prompt_single_01-help-0-textfooterglimmer&trkEmail=eml-email_editorial_prompt_single_01-help-0-textfooterglimmer-null-icq8ji~mqjujyk3~4e-null-null&eid=icq8ji-mqjujyk3-4e\n\n© 2026 LinkedIn Corporation, 1zwnj000 West Maude Avenue, Sunnyvale, CA 94085.\nLinkedIn and the LinkedIn logo are registered trademarks of LinkedIn.','incoming-complaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 17:35:52',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a6652ba6-6d97-11f1-89d5-e86538d58b3c','e754e5ff-6703-11f1-a09a-8107a00d61c0','Re: Yashica, take the cringe out of networking','loharyashica@gmail.com','editors-noreply@linkedin.com',NULL,'Dear LinkedIn Editors,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"Yashica, take the cringe out of networking