rita.edu.\nWe look forward to your participation.\nBest regards,\nICPC AlgoQueen Team 2026.\nAmrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham | ICPC Foundation.\n[Amrita University]\nDisclaimer: The information transmitted in this email, including attachments, is intended only for the person(s) or entity to which it is addressed and may contain confidential and/or privileged material. Any review, retransmission, dissemination or other use of, or taking of any action in reliance upon this information by persons or entities other than the intended recipient is prohibited. Any views expressed in any message are those of the individual sender and may not necessarily reflect the views of Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham. If you received this in error, please contact the sender and destroy any copies of this information.\n','incoming-complaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 17:35:52',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a678c6bc-6d97-11f1-89d5-e86538d58b3c','e754e5ff-6703-11f1-a09a-8107a00d61c0','Re: Enhance Your Problem-Solving Skills with Binary Search','loharyashica@gmail.com','icpc@am.amrita.edu',NULL,'Dear ICPC Amritapuri,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"Enhance Your Problem-Solving Skills with Binary Search\".\n\nYour reference ID is #e754e5ff. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','OUTGOING',NULL,'2026-06-21 17:35:52',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a679640d-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,' \n\nSolution Challenge 2026 - 48 Hours Left\n2 Days Left Banner\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/solutionChallenge2026/sc-2day.png] Hi\nYashica Lohar,\n\nJust 48 hours left, and the energy is incredible! We know the final push can be\nintense, but don\'t let it overwhelm you.\n\nPro tip: Submit your prototype right now. It takes the \"deadline jitters\" away.\nWe can\'t wait to see your submission!\n\nNote: It is mandatory to use the given presentation template for project\nsubmission: Download now →\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fpresentation%2Fd%2F1xiWuM0vqqjPUR-eAR4PIzu_CaLucYEJfLZOE8GXYyjo%2Fexport%2Fpptx/1/0108019dcd4f3338-4afd1a40-e75e-4808-8cd6-2eacc2779042-000000/8L8a4nGxc3gmLCG2jksjjD9GDjs=256]\n\n\nHOW YOUR PROTOTYPE WILL BE EVALUATED:\n\n• Your Prototype Deck will be the first thing to be reviewed.\n\n• Only if your PPT passes, your Video Demo will be reviewed.\n\n• Only if your Demo Video passes, your Prototype will be reviewed.\n\n• Only if all the above submission passes, your GitHub Repo will be reviewed.\n\nClick Here to Submit Your Prototype\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Fsolution-challenge-2026%2Fregistration%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage%26utm_campaign=%26utm_term=%26utm_content=/1/0108019dcd4f3338-4afd1a40-e75e-4808-8cd6-2eacc2779042-000000/yg1fu6ajMnGFF163Qey_R_19YPc=256]\nSubmission Requirements\n1\nProblem Statement\n\nClearly define the issue your team is addressing.\n\n2\nSolution Overview\n\nExplain how your prototype solves the problem.\n\n3\nPrototype Link\n\nA live MVP link demonstrating core functionality.\n\n4\nProject Deck\n\nDetailing your solution, architecture, and impact.\n\n5\nGitHub Repository\n\nPublic link to your well-structured source code.\n\n\nYOUR TREASURE MAP TO SUBMISSION\n\nGet your project ready for the 28th April deadline using our 6-step,\nbeginner-focused guide, featuring ready-to-use prompts to help you build and\nsubmit from scratch.\n\nClick Here for the Guide\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fdocument%2Fd%2F1nBtrGqdJWuIOOMAVkw3rfKohoaTMl8UyOYf4QB3qADs%2Fedit%3Ftab=t.0%23heading=h.r62xehm9jalv/1/0108019dcd4f3338-4afd1a40-e75e-4808-8cd6-2eacc2779042-000000/uHPjVW2vhfWUW8fCAk1d_9SeuNc=256]\n\nFocus on clearly conveying your idea, not building a fully polished\nsolution—impact matters more than perfection.\n\nYou can continue to work on your prototype until the clock stops, but your entry\nmust be initiated. Submit your prototype immediately!\n\nRegards,\nTeam Hack2skill\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/I0/0108019dcd4f3338-4afd1a40-e75e-4808-8cd6-2eacc2779042-000000/gyU23fl5e1izQorowbd4uDFFnR0=256]\n\n \n\n \n\nFacebook\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_facebook.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019dcd4f3338-4afd1a40-e75e-4808-8cd6-2eacc2779042-000000/b3TCgas_ZJXJDauUax1XquzIhWc=256\nTwitter\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_twitter.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fhack2skill/1/0108019dcd4f3338-4afd1a40-e75e-4808-8cd6-2eacc2779042-000000/CiVoJpHSmDuerE507qIwiL37rSY=256\nInstagram\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_instagram.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019dcd4f3338-4afd1a40-e75e-4808-8cd6-2eacc2779042-000000/F9HOpcZlT8r0Jou9qS_YLDTkiPc=256\nLinkedIn\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_linkedin.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019dcd4f3338-4afd1a40-e75e-4808-8cd6-2eacc2779042-000000/SzZOOoXCQ-H49ZHUcmHpKWEsjjY=256\nYouTube\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_youtube.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fchannel%2FUCw2br80x_dpvJoAsSCC-bGA/1/0108019dcd4f3338-4afd1a40-e75e-4808-8cd6-2eacc2779042-000000/U8gT2qCCgaQ0UGTEj_4J6NlD8H4=256\nWhatsApp\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_whatsapp.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fapi.whatsapp.com%2Fsend%2F%3Fphone=919870330830%26text%26type=phone_number%26app_absent=0/1/0108019dcd4f3338-4afd1a40-e75e-4808-8cd6-2eacc2779042-000000/erAL8WIF_S0FimC8I6LBvrT7LjE=256\nDiscord\n[https://h2svision.github.io/