 benchmark track!\n\n🚀 AI RESUME CHALLENGE – PART 2\n\nThis challenge is focused on one thing: How strong is your resume really?\n\nUsing Redrob AI\'s Resume Ranker, you can now evaluate your resume and understand\nhow it performs against real-world hiring standards. Use our official link to\naccess Redrob AI for the Mini challenge.\n\n⚠️ Note: Use the below link only to be eligible for the Mini Challenge\n\n➔ ACCESS REDROB AI\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.redrob.ai%2F%3Futm_source=20Junmail%26utm_medium=H2S/1/0108019ee48ccad4-97a79b48-f7e1-406a-90f4-64fe123ea78f-000000/4tV4VJ1MeHLc5dwvaWomQm0nVxQ=258]\n\n🎯 Your Challenge Checklist:\n * Access the active Redrob AI workspace hub.\n * Run the Resume Ranker engine feature using your latest profile draft.\n * Generate your metric Resume Rank analysis output data.\n * Submit your evaluation score through the form available inside the\n   Submissions Section of your INDIA RUNS dashboard panel.\n\nThat\'s it! We\'ll evaluate entries based on your overall Resume Rank Score,\nResume Quality parameters, and system Profile Completeness indicators. The\nstrongest profiles will be shortlisted for exciting rewards and recognition.\n\n📘 Need Help?\n\nWe\'ve shared a detailed strategy guide\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fdocument%2Fd%2Fe%2F2PACX-1vRJoCFU2kDy_i6w3ERP3pnZicY0v8SpVjdwZg9dBMNQqfVuIJ5hd9sUszjMJOKGhHURhKfO0DPGKbko%2Fpub/1/0108019ee48ccad4-97a79b48-f7e1-406a-90f4-64fe123ea78f-000000/aRhqOAMKNZJUV8apmFSOVsYCxs0=258]\ninside your portal workspace to help you map out:\n\n• How to access the Resume Ranker interface smoothly\n• How the automated Resume Ranking parsing engine functions\n• Tactical steps to optimize parameters and improve your score\n\n* Make sure you review the documentation guide files before uploading your entry\nscore!\n\n📥 SUBMIT YOUR RESUME RANK\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Findia_runs%2Fdashboard%2Fforms%2F6a350e67af06b9a6b48c6e62%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage/1/0108019ee48ccad4-97a79b48-f7e1-406a-90f4-64fe123ea78f-000000/RgqthV_xfvr21IF2W3h5ZSkVhf8=258]\n\n🔓 Unlock Full Access to Redrob AI\n\nTo upgrade your account space and open advanced evaluation parameters completely\nfree, apply our community promo:\n\nStep 1\nLog in to your configured Redrob AI account portal.\nStep 2\nNavigate straight to the Upgrade Plan hub area.\nStep 3\nBrowse to the Business Plan configuration section and select: India Runs Promo\nStep 4\nApply the specialized event activation string code:\nH2SXREDROB2026\nStep 5\nAuthorize the system verification transaction checkout.\n(Note: The promo will be valid for 3 months after redeeming.)\nStep 6\nEnjoy full capability access to Redrob AI and its advanced parsing filters!\n\n⏰ DEADLINE: Sunday, 21 June 2026\n11:59 PM IST System Closing\n\nThe first challenge helped you build. This challenge helps you measure.\n\nLet\'s see where your resume stands on the ecosystem leaderboard!\n\n \n\nBest Regards,\nTeam Hack2skill × Redrob AI\n#IndiaRuns\n\nThis operational message was sent to registered profiles of the INDIA RUNS\ncommunity. All rights reserved © 2026.\n\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/I0/0108019ee48ccad4-97a79b48-f7e1-406a-90f4-64fe123ea78f-000000/rQ_ppSn44ElavNp8ZF9LgkMqNTw=258]\n\n \n\n \n\nFacebook\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_facebook.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019ee48ccad4-97a79b48-f7e1-406a-90f4-64fe123ea78f-000000/kUxntWhP673jqAXK72lgbjebi9Q=258\nTwitter\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_twitter.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fhack2skill/1/0108019ee48ccad4-97a79b48-f7e1-406a-90f4-64fe123ea78f-000000/j3Hjoj8Iz1eHQvjC6jbBnKfR9dg=258\nInstagram\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s