tation%2Fd%2F1xiWuM0vqqjPUR-eAR4PIzu_CaLucYEJfLZOE8GXYyjo%2Fexport%2Fpptx/1/0108019dd0057679-75b7572c-0bad-4df2-89a6-f373d14aec52-000000/_dpp686D5A0F33LauVIEIGHYj-E=256]\n\n\nHOW YOUR PROTOTYPE WILL BE EVALUATED:\n\n• Your Prototype Deck will be the first thing to be reviewed.\n\n• Only if your PPT passes, your Video Demo will be reviewed.\n\n• Only if your Demo Video passes, your Prototype will be reviewed.\n\n• Only if all the above passes, your GitHub Repo will be reviewed.\n\nClick Here to Submit Your Prototype\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Fsolution-challenge-2026%2Fregistration%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage%26utm_campaign=%26utm_term=%26utm_content=/1/0108019dd0057679-75b7572c-0bad-4df2-89a6-f373d14aec52-000000/ZeMou7zbLDmp3yQICZrd_h3sWPQ=256]\nRequired for Submission:\n✓\nProblem Statement\n✓\nSolution Overview\n✓\nPrototype Link (Live MVP)\n✓\nProject Deck\n✓\nGitHub Repository (Public)\n✓\nDemo Video\n\nFocus on clearly conveying your idea, not building a fully polished\nsolution—impact matters more than perfection.\n\nRegards,\nTeam Hack2skill\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/I0/0108019dd0057679-75b7572c-0bad-4df2-89a6-f373d14aec52-000000/pcoqgSBjqnxaXAqOC7u_oU35Vzo=256]\n\n \n\n \n\nFacebook\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_facebook.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019dd0057679-75b7572c-0bad-4df2-89a6-f373d14aec52-000000/bbOd45xzWCOJdBXED81CXhvas3I=256\nTwitter\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_twitter.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fhack2skill/1/0108019dd0057679-75b7572c-0bad-4df2-89a6-f373d14aec52-000000/GFFdGTgnmFSy9ZxNGXFsKjv0G_8=256\nInstagram\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_instagram.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/01