r Video Demo will be reviewed.\n\n• Only if your Demo Video passes, your prototype will be reviewed.\n\n• Only if all the above passes, your GitHub Repo will be reviewed.\n\nRequired for Submission:\n✓\nProblem Statement\n✓\nSolution Overview\n✓\nPrototype Link (Live MVP)\n✓\nProject Deck\n✓\nGitHub Repository (Public)\n✓\nDemo Video\n\nRegards,\nTeam Hack2skill\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/I0/0108019dd4c87ddf-2ff5b71d-51fa-45a5-b11d-7893e6d96c16-000000/UYkhOqEc3gl0b_AfofEb2McPIxk=256]\n\n \n\n \n\nFacebook\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_facebook.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019dd4c87ddf-2ff5b71d-51fa-45a5-b11d-7893e6d96c16-000000/o4SPJMe9wFEYJxSqdQaMSkCXDZc=256\nTwitter\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_twitter.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fhack2skill/1/0108019dd4c87ddf-2ff5b71d-51fa-45a5-b11d-7893e6d96c16-000000/K7FUlkRFu8xZKaJV8N4oGD4GV5c=256\nInstagram\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_instagram.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019dd4c87ddf-2ff5b71d-51fa-45a5-b11d-7893e6d96c16-000000/7KeCTeDHtVSdUFW4Tv75HKIWyaY=256\nLinkedIn\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_linkedin.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019dd4c87ddf-2ff5b71d-51fa-45a5-b11d-7893e6d96c16-000000/Tzmo6Vmm3FhamYUC7jpKB4wZDbg=256\nYouTube\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_youtube.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fchannel%2FUCw2br80x_dpvJoAsSCC-bGA/1/0108019dd4c87ddf-2ff5b71d-51fa-45a5-b11d-7893e6d96c16-000000/TMycIi4W5Jr_HRrtwRLQFuF3lZM=256\nWhatsApp\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_whatsapp.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/h