633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dear LinkedIn,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"Yashica, your posts got 60 impressions last week\".\n\nYour reference ID is #d69e6b3d. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a7977a6f-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n\nIntroducing CoinGecko\'s Demo API Keyed Plan [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/56d4caf6-dde1-4a9c-acfb-821e07703a70.png]\n\n\nGM Geckos 👋\n\n\nEver wished you could pull live crypto prices directly into Microsoft Excel without copy-pasting from websites or setting up complex VBA macros and Power Queries?\n\n\nWe just launchedCoinGecko for Excel, our official add-in to easily pull real-time and historical crypto market data directly into your spreadsheets using simple=CG()formulas.\n\n\n\nCoinGecko for Excel Features\n\n\nReal-time Crypto Asset Prices\nPull prices from 18,000+ coins, 37 million+ onchain tokens, and 2,000+ NFTs using the formula:\n * =CG.PRICE(\"[coin_id]\")\n   \n * =CG.ONCHAIN(\"[onchain_network_id], [token_address]\")\n   \n * =CG.NFT(\"[nft_id]\")\n   \n\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/237f573f-0de7-49ab-bbdd-9db4788da43a.gif]\n\nHistorical Prices For Any Specific Date\nAccess over 12 years of data all the way back to 2013 using the formula:\n=CG.HISTORY(\"[coin_id]\", \"[YYYY-MM-DD]\")\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/3dc5ae30-4751-425f-a761-bf7de0f99d0c.gif]\n\nBulk Market Data In A Single Formula\nRetrieve up to 10,000 cryptocurrencies from the top market cap and various coin categories using the formula:\n * =CG.TOP(\"[number]\")\n   \n * =CG.TOP(\"[number]\", [category_id]\")\n   \n\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/96694186-7d95-488f-b96c-d2fec32c88c0.gif]\n\nOne Click Bulk Data Refresh\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/2f62f687-73b8-4245-a14d-ccc2bc7a650a.gif]\n\nWhat Can You Build With CoinGecko for Excel?\n * Portfolio Trackers:Monitor your holdings in real-time\n   \n * Crypto Tax Calculators:Pull historical prices for cost basis calculations\n   \n * Financial Models:Integrate live and historical pricing directly into institutional financial models and projections\n   \n * Coin & Token Watchlists:Track trending assets using formulas like=CG.TOP(5000, “real-world-assets-rwa\")for RWAs\n   \n\n\n\n\nGet Started in 3 Steps\n 1. Install the free add-in from the Microsoft Marketplace\n    \n 2. Enter yourCoinGecko API key [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9fP&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=h2Btdaa&]in the Excel taskpane\n    \n 3. Type=CG.PRICE(\"bitcoin\")and get the real-time price in your spreadsheet\n    \n\n\n\n\nInstall CoinGecko for Excel [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9f2&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hPIN0hm&]\n\n\nResources\n\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/95feeeb2-ef52-4dda-90e2-9250072f6730.png]\n\n📖Step-by-Step Setup Guide: [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9fC&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hpE5rYO&]How to Import Crypto Prices into Excel [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9f4&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=h2HeFZU&]\n\n\n📚Full Documentation:CoinGecko for Excel Docs [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9fN&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hrMwdCr&]\n\n\n\nNeed Higher Rate Limits?\n\n\nThe free Demo API is perfect for personal use, but if you\'re building dashboards that refresh frequently or tracking hundreds of assets, you may want to upgrade to a paid plan for more refresh limits and call credits.\n\n\n\nView API Plans [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9fJ&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=h4iDd3f&]\n\n\nPrefer Google Sheets?\n\n\nIf your team primarily works in Google Workspace, we have you covered. Our official CoinGecko for Google Sheets Add-on offers the exact same real-time data and capabilities using a simple=COINGECKO()formula.\n\n\n\nInstall CoinGecko for Sheets [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9fO&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hCnsQRw&]\n\n\nNeed help? Submit a ticket here [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9fR&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hyFWsyq&].\n\n\n\n\nTrack Crypto Prices 24/7\n\n\n\n\nDownload the CoinGecko Mobile App on Google Play [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/dc032587-95fd-45dc-a849-fbfbe023957c.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9fl&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hadwsVz&]\n\n\nDownload the CoinGecko Mobile App on App Store [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/8e0c936e-9cdf-4813-9eaa-5ef19c769c46.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9fM&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hd9PF8e&]\n\n\n\n\n\nVisit our Twitter page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/twitter4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9fI&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=h2ktaxo&]\n\nVisit our Instagram page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/instagram4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9fK&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=ha0BFq1&]\n\nVisit our YouTube page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/youtube4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9fA&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hFYcQC7&]\n\nVisit our Telegram page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/telegram4.png] [https://newsle