le-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;color:#000;width:600px;margin:0 auto\" width=\"600\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"column column-1\" width=\"100%\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;font-weight:400;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"col-pad\" style=\"padding-bottom:5px;padding-top:5px\"><table class=\"image_block block-1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"width:100%\" align=\"center\"><div style=\"max-width:600px\"><img src=\"https://efiles.webengage.com/cdn-cgi/image/q=70/images/we15ba20153/nxtwave%20launchpad%20email%20banner.png\" style=\"display:block;height:auto;border:0;width:100%\" width=\"600\" alt title height=\"auto\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"text_block block-2\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;word-break:break-word\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"pad\"><div style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><div class style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Arial,\'Helvetica Neue\',Helvetica,sans-serif;mso-line-height-alt:16.8px;color:#000;line-height:1.2\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;mso-line-height-alt:18px\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; color: #000000; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">Hi&nbsp;YashicaLohar,</span><br></span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"text_block block-3\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;word-break:break-word\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"pad\"><div style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><div class style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,\'Helvetica Neue\',Helvetica,sans-serif;mso-line-height-alt:14.399999999999999px;color:#000;line-height:1.2\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\">\n<span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">Most students spend their summer solving random LeetCode problems without structure or consistency. The students who crack strong internships and placements usually do the opposite; they prepare with the&nbsp;<strong>right plan, the right problems, and consistent practice.</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:14.399999999999999px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\">\n<span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">NxtWave Launchpad is launching the&nbsp;<strong>DSA Summer Sprint</strong>:&nbsp;<em>a 10-week rigorous live cohort program designed to help you build strong DSA consistency this summer</em>. Whether you\'re preparing for placements, internships, or just want to strengthen your problem-solving foundation — this is your shot.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:14.399999999999999px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\"><strong><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://c.webengage.com/lw/g1.jpg?p=eyJsYyI6In4xNWJhMjAxNTMiLCJsIjoiMWU5NjkzOTU5NWIzMDRmNDMzYTg1ZWMzN2Y1ZDU4MWI1MWZhYzQ3YiIsImMiOiJhNWY3NGM4Yy05NmM2LTQ2NTMtYTJiZC05ZDRjNWY2NzVkOTkiLCJlbSI6ImxvaGFyeWFzaGljYUBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJlIjoiMjc0ajlrbCIsInYiOiI2ZGlhZ2doIiwicyI6IjQ0MTA1YTc1LWM2ZTMtNDdkNi05NjU0LTk2MmY4Yjc3NTg2MyIsImoiOiJ%2BNjhkZDFqMSIsImV2ZW50IjoiZW1haWxfY2xpY2siLCJjdGEiOiJ%2BNjRkN2I4ODIiLCJ0b1VSTCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vbGF1bmNocGFkLm54dHdhdmUudGVjaC9kc2Etc3VtbWVyc3ByaW50LyJ9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"https://launchpad.nxtwave.tech/dsa-summersprint/\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #2060e4;\">Click here to Enroll now (Batch starts on 16th May)</a></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\">\n<span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>What makes it perfect right now:</strong></span></p><ul style=\"line-height:1.2;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\"><li>\n<span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">Led by&nbsp;<strong>SDEs from top companies like&nbsp;Google,&nbsp;Microsoft,&nbsp;Coinbase&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Intuit&nbsp;</strong>(IIT &amp; IIIT alumni) — people who’ve been there and done that</span></li><li><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">Live sessions every Monday, Wednesday &amp; Friday&nbsp;<strong>evenings</strong>&nbsp;so you can manage both your internship and placement prep comfortably</span></li><li>\n<span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">Daily assignments to keep you sharp and consistent</span></li><li><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">Weekly contests &amp; company-specific mock OAs (based on real OA patterns)</span></li><li><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">As you progress and showcase consistency, you unlock bonus support — mock interviews, 1:1 mentor guidance, and more from the NxtWave Launchpad ecosystem</span></li></ul><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\"><em>To ensure students stay committed throughout the 10-week sprint, there is a one-time commitment fee of ₹499 during final enrolment.</em></span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:14.399999999999999px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\">\n<span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>GET&nbsp;</strong><strong>100% FEE BACK on successful completion of the program</strong>, making the effective cost&nbsp;<strong>zero</strong>&nbsp;for consistent participants.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:14.399999999999999px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">----------------------------</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:14.399999999999999px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">If you’re not looking for a live cohort but still want structured support this summer,&nbsp;<strong>choose the support/resources you need for your internship or placement preparation here (takes less than 30 seconds):<br>\n</strong><a href=\"https://c.webengage.com/lw/g1.jpg?p=eyJsYyI6In4xNWJhMjAxNTMiLCJsIjoiMWU5NjkzOTU5NWIzMDRmNDMzYTg1ZWMzN2Y1ZDU4MWI1MWZhYzQ3YiIsImMiOiJhNWY3NGM4Yy05NmM2LTQ2NTMtYTJiZC05ZDRjNWY2NzVkOTkiLCJlbSI6ImxvaGFyeWFzaGljYUBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJlIjoiMjc0ajlrbCIsInYiOiI2ZGlhZ2doIiwicyI6IjQ0MTA1YTc1LWM2ZTMtNDdkNi05NjU0LTk2MmY4Yjc3NTg2MyIsImoiOiJ%2BNjhkZDFqMSIsImV2ZW50IjoiZW1haWxfY2xpY2siLCJjdGEiOiJ%2BOGEzYjYzM2IiLCJ0b1VSTCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vdGlueXVybC5jb20vc3Vtand1dnoifQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://tinyurl.com/sumjwuvz\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #2060e4;\" rel=\"noopener\">https://tinyurl.com/sumjwuvz</a></span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:14.399999999999999px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\">\n<span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\"><em>What makes this different is that our team analysed 5000+ OA questions from recent placement seasons across top colleges to curate sheets, contests, mock OAs, and interview prep support aligned with actual hiring patterns — something students usually don’t get access to in such a structured format.</em></span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:14.399999999999999px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">Check out your senior batch\'s placement&nbsp;<a href=\"https://c.webengage.com/lw/g1.jpg?p=eyJsYyI6In4xNWJhMjAxNTMiLCJsIjoiMWU5NjkzOTU5NWIzMDRmNDMzYTg1ZWMzN2Y1ZDU4MWI1MWZhYzQ3YiIsImMiOiJhNWY3NGM4Yy05NmM2LTQ2NTMtYTJiZC05ZDRjNWY2NzVkOTkiLCJlbSI6ImxvaGFyeWFzaGljYUBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJlIjoiMjc0ajlrbCIsInYiOiI2ZGlhZ2doIiwicyI6IjQ0MTA1YTc1LWM2ZTMtNDdkNi05NjU0LTk2MmY4Yjc3NTg2MyIsImoiOiJ%2BNjhkZDFqMSIsImV2ZW50IjoiZW1haWxfY2xpY2siLCJjdGEiOiJ%2BN2Q3MDMwMDMiLCJ0b1VSTCI6Imh0dHBzOi8vbGF1bmNocGFkLm54dHdhdmUudGVjaC9zdWNjZXNzX3N0b3JpZXMifQ%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://launchpad.nxtwave.tech/success_stories\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #2060e4;\" rel=\"noopener\">success stories here</a>.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:14.399999999999999px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">If you have any questions or need help with registration, feel free to reach out on WhatsApp: 9281411507</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:14.399999999999999px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\">\n<span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">Your summer is only ~10 weeks long. Used properly, it can completely change your internship and placement outcomes.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:14.399999999999999px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">Let’s crack this together&nbsp;🚀</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:14.399999999999999px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">Best regards,</span><br><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">Team NxtWave Launchpad</span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"row row-2\" align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td><table class=\"row-content stack\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;color:#000;width:600px;margin:0 auto\" width=\"600\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"column column-1\" width=\"100%\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;font-weight:400;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"col-pad\" style=\"padding-bottom:5px;padding-top:5px\"><table class=\"divider_block block-1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"pad\" align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"divider_inner\" style=\"font-size:1px;line-height:1px;border-top:1px solid #bbb\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word;\"> </span></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"social_block block-2\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"pad\" align=\"center\"><table class=\"social-table\" width=\"173px\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0\"><a href=\"https://c.webengage.com/lw/g1.jpg?p=eyJsYyI6In4x