e to Premium Business\n[https://t1.em.linkedin.com/r/?id=h3596d666-ac75-4eff-93e3-1ab95ee9bc40,8496b4,669415&e=bWNpZD03MjYyNTY5ODEwMzc3NDk0NTI4JnRyaz1lbWwtbWt0Zy1wcmVtLWFjcS1mdC1idXNpbmVzcy11cG0mc3JjPWUtZW1s&s=ItIy7b-VZVBrKe-fDj4Ku0I7oAl4NQt_LlQVButZwuU].\n\n‌\n\n\nWith Premium Business, you can: \n\n * Stand out with a credible LinkedIn presence: Elevate your profile with\n   dynamic cover images, AI-powered profile writing, and featured content.  \n\n * Expand your reach: Get 13x more profile views on average with Premium.\n   Convert profile views into opportunities with a custom button and enhanced\n   visibility across LinkedIn.\n\n * Find and contact the right people: Grow your network with up to 16x more\n   connections on average. Use unlimited search filters and connect with clients\n   and strategic partners with 15 InMail credits monthly.\n\nStart your 1 month free trial today.\n\nTry for free\n[https://t1.em.linkedin.com/r/?id=h3596d666-ac75-4eff-93e3-1ab95ee9bc40,8496b4,669416&e=bWNpZD03MjYyNTY5ODEwMzc3NDk0NTI4JnRyaz1lbWwtbWt0Zy1wcmVtLWFjcS1mdC1idXNpbmVzcy11cG0mc3JjPWUtZW1s&s=1iS7yRqKPM8FPYhPaUEchogErfpWY-LCArm3XRVYmxY]\n\nTerms and Conditions:\n\nAfter your promotional period, you will automatically be charged for a\nsubscription on a monthly or annual basis (at your choice) unless you cancel.\nThis promotion ends 05,20,2026. Learn more.\n[https://t1.em.linkedin.com/r/?id=h3596d666-ac75-4eff-93e3-1ab95ee9bc40,8496b4,669417&e=bWNpZD03MjYyNTY5ODEwMzc3NDk0NTI4JnRyaz1lbWwtbWt0Zy1wcmVtLWFjcS1mdC1idXNpbmVzcy11cG0mc3JjPWUtZW1s&s=zxeYfjdT--GO3-iDVn0gZm4d_19egbm07o4aDO6qJDw]\n\nFor Who\'s viewed your profile, first & last name may not be listed for profile\nviewers who have chosen to remain semi- or fully-anonymous via their privacy\nsettings. InMail credits expire after 90 days or when the subscription ends.\n\n‌\n\n\n*Custom button is available to Premium Business, Recruiter Lite, Sales Navigator\nCore and Advanced customers. Premium Career plan subscribers do not have access\nto Custom Button.\n\n \n\nFooter Mercado English\n\nThis email was intended for Yashica Lohar (Flipkart GWC 7.0 Scholar CSE ’28 @\nIIIT Jabalpur 2 ⭐ @Codechef)\nLearn why we included this.\n[https://t1.em.linkedin.com/r/?id=h3596d666-ac75-4eff-93e3-1ab95ee9bc40,8496b4,669422&e=bWNpZD03MjYyNTY5ODEwMzc3NDk0NTI4JnRyaz1lbWwtbWt0Zy1wcmVtLWFjcS1mdC1idXNpbmVzcy11cG0mc3JjPWUtZW1s&s=1SPXW1qYZG7TGiRsWGeCpMIZWMSyDikJcBtB0Owf-No]\n\nThis is an occasional email to help you get the most out of LinkedIn.\n\n Unsubscribe\n[https://t1.em.linkedin.com/r/?id=h3596d666-ac75-4eff-93e3-1ab95ee9bc40,8496b4,669423&e=bWNpZD03MjYyNTY5ODEwMzc3NDk0NTI4JnRyaz1lbWwtbWt0Zy1wcmVtLWFjcS1mdC1idXNpbmVzcy11cG0mc3JjPWUtZW1sJnAxPUFRR1RDLWFzVmt1eTNnQUFBWnpnN1lsM0pHUnhFd0pCMUFUelVQWUc2ZVNzQVZRNzJMakJrSG5BU0J5YzgyUU5jc3FlY1YycC1ralJrOU53TFcwJnAyPTQ2NjkwNjMmcDM9ODY4OTMzMiZwND0yMDI2LTA1LTEy&s=skmACDENRKHOERmdzDe05DuhQr-TqVI_PZ-7j06NuHU] ·  Help\n[https://t1.em.linkedin.com/r/?id=h3596d666-ac75-4eff-93e3-1ab95ee9bc40,8496b4,66941a&e=bWNpZD03MjYyNTY5ODEwMzc3NDk0NTI4JnRyaz1lbWwtbWt0Zy1wcmVtLWFjcS1mdC1idXNpbmVzcy11cG0mc3JjPWUtZW1s&s=IzrlFk1AD7_QhNKtNMAry2REIJJpEGLpIeUFRHAq_wc]\nLinkedIn\n[https://res1.em.linkedin.com/res/tracking/linkedin-blue-80x20.png]https://t1.em.linkedin.com/r/?id=h3596d666-ac75-4eff-93e3-1ab95ee9bc40,8496b4,66941b&e=bWNpZD03MjYyNTY5ODEwMzc3NDk0NTI4JnRyaz1lbWwtbWt0Zy1wcmVtLWFjcS1mdC1idXNpbmVzcy11cG0mc3JjPWUtZW1s&s=IaMWmvRc9s2Tmxbh0NHfd-5RBNAysHC4V3BITB2A0c0\n©2026, LinkedIn Ireland Unlimited Company. All rights reserved.\nLinkedIn Ireland Unlimited Company, Gardner House, Wilton Plaza, Wilton Place,\nDublin 2, Ireland.\nLinkedIn and the LinkedIn logo are registered trademarks of LinkedIn.\n\n \n\n[https://t1.em.linkedin.com/r/?id=h3596d666-ac75-4eff-93e3-1ab95ee9bc40,8496b4,1]','incoming-complaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a8cdc51e-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dear LinkedIn Premium,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"Yashica, thanks for being a valued member\".\n\nYour reference ID is #d69e6b3d. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a8f2ea74-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'\n\nIntroducing CoinGecko\'s Demo API Keyed Plan [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/f1aeab9e-6cee-46a7-a8f2-2693408ab57d.png]\n\n\nGM Geckos 👋\n\n\nBuilding a scalable crypto product means matching the right data delivery method to the right task. Using REST API polling for everything works, but you can significantly optimize for lower latency and better cost efficiency. CoinGecko API now gives you the flexibility to build smarter with three native delivery methods –REST, WebSocket,andWebhook.\n\n\n\nREST API: On-Demand Requests\n\n\nPull the exact data you need, when you need it. REST is the industry standard for historical data, ad hoc queries, and static content lookups across our 80+ endpoints.\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/95a21f0c-0dda-477a-9041-35a255d19501.gif]\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/d7de57b9-9847-4c0f-a014-10006150f53c.png]\nBest suited for:\n * Ad-Hoc Queries:Fetching specific information like current prices.\n   \n * Historical Analysis:Querying large datasets for past market trends.\n   \n * Portfolio Snapshots:Getting a point-in-time summary of token balances.\n   \n\n\n\nView All REST Endpoints [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9g7&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hruUFKA&]\n\nWebSocket API (Beta): Ultra-Low Latency Data Streams\n\n\nDeliver real-time, ultra-low latency crypto data to your users instantly. Power live charts and instant price alerts with four continuous streaming channels:\n * Coin Prices & Market Data (CGSimplePrice [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9gi&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hQ810PZ&])\n   \n * Onchain Token Prices (OnchainSimpleTokenPrice [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9zh&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hh344AC&])\n   \n * Onchain OHLCV Data (OnchainOHLCV [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9zd&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hFiJ3Bd&])\n   \n * Onchain Trades & Swaps (OnchainTrade [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9z0&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=haSfP2E&])\n   \n\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/36cbcd1a-f8ea-4666-a534-aa42ffa4b95d.gif]\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/5d52726b-3528-4f6a-a53b-26d7327a078e.png]\nBest suited for:\n * Live Candlestick Charts:Powering interactive charts with tick-by-tick OHLCV data.\n   \n * Real-Time Price Feeds:Embedding live updates into DeFi dashboards.\n   \n * High-Frequency Trading Bots:Receiving split-second price updates.\n   \n\n\n\nView WebSocket Docs [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9zp&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hFzr4iE&]\n\nWebhook (New): Event-Driven Push Notifications\n\n\nKeep your token database up-to-date without constant polling. Listen to thecg.coin.info.updatedevent to receive automated payloads the moment an asset\'s metadata is updated. You only consume credits when an event triggers.\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/8799d404-5935-41b7-8a57-d8d32f82e6ee.png]\nBest suited for:\n * Database Synchronization:Keeping token metadata up-to-date automatically.\n   \n * Event-Driven Workflows:Triggering alerts for logo, name, or symbol changes.\n   \n * Compliance Monitoring:Tracking contract migrations or security breaches.\n   \n\n\n\nView Webhook Docs [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9za&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hF5ssBS&]\n\n\nChoose the Right Method for Your Workflow\n\n\nProduction applications require a mix of delivery methods. Here is exactly when to use each:\n\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/d25892c9-4a33-4881-89a0-42beeb2a5dec.gif]\n\n * REST (Pull):You request, we respond. Best for historical data, static content, and ad hoc queries.\n   \n * WebSocket (Stream):Persistent connection. Best for real-time price feeds, live dashboards, and tick-by-tick data.\n   \n * Webhook (Push):We send updates when something changes. Best for metadata syncs, automated alerts, and event-driven workflows.\n   \n\n\n\nLearn More [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9zn&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hhk5xt&]\n\n\nReady to Build Scalable Applications?\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/36bdc2e6-3f9c-4b61-8ef0-6cde3de1cccf.png]\nThe free Demo API is perfect for testing REST endpoints, but production applications often require a mix of all three delivery methods. Upgrade to a paid plan (Analyst and above) to unlock WebSockets and Webhooks.\n\n\n\nUpgrade to Analyst [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9zQ&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hdBKpwy&]\n\n\nLet Us Know Your Data Needs\n\n\nWe are constantly improving our API delivery methods.Share your feedback and feature requests with us [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9z3&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hFIkPXv&].\n\n\n\nNeed help? Submit a ticket here [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9zs&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hpQMdla&].\n\n\n\n\nTrack Crypto Prices 24/7\n\n\n\n\nDownload the CoinGecko Mobile App on Google Play [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/5addeaec-0444-4c5f-90e0-59bd24f826f1.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9zy&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hQxrcv3&]\n\n\nDownload the CoinGecko Mobile App on App Store [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/19e2978e-a6f9-4572-9e79-35fff20b78e6.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9zc&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hsGnnBk&]\n\n\n\n\n\nVisit our Twitter page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/twitter4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9zF&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hrXocJp&]\n\nVisit our Instagram page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/instagram4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9zr&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hdeLyzJ&]\n\nVisit our YouTube page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/youtube4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9zP&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hFuYFdR&]\n\nVisit our Telegram page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/telegram4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9z2&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hC6j07g&]\n\nVisit our Facebook page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/facebook4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9zC&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=h0bl0xv&]\nCoinGecko [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9z4&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=h02zWN&]• [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9zN&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hCLWrVS&]CoinGecko API [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9zJ&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hPTRptX&]• [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9zO&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hQticQa&]GeckoTerminal DEX Tracker [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=9zR&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=h28nQnb&]• [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/