about\nhigh-income skills\n[https://link.coursera.org/f/a/VK8lhEpQiRVdZb7FLkvWdg~~/AAQRxRA~/hfrK7VZMn4-aYLi-a3YhyYY5ixgYqUOuYZsqKvuKM-B_dsI0T8yDDu4Ac7mi551biY0Vtb6iXTDm1mEBlWJYj3E8AmWdCGh2VQ-SPtBXzkot0RevXSfhlbHt4TX5eS2cwewx-VA85Kj38TO-2GcrYqxfeILEStvvoMHffTUA-c94zaMxYF-aoi77P0YHdc9mLBbSnSvfg5gKaJJPj1LrwHil-ZNSvQHGAoWMJfBcku3jTzynqOljyN9bYgbeydG5RNehVRH4no2NiaYUhfusIaXHM38Vp0EudVXlgPjp6rvbH7p1Y93_BUbn18iIll_4oK4rEpM-idAn2_nDcLPkrw~~].\nTogether, we’ll explore skills that are valuable across industries, connected to\nhigh-paying roles, and that you can use to grow your career.\n\nThis week: data analysis\n[https://link.coursera.org/f/a/gMpPnIL-wFX9kw2PTtlwQg~~/AAQRxRA~/jGKIOd5S-zzYWQHLuHcfiCV8X_5_k742cF_aal6beLfU1BPAiPyTIhL4EVxJvvRor4awba96CECM-mRWAwjk_lmBkG-iLejon6EndTjwSaPrwpMC6Yx3DUfWvbuN0HDxvTSn_MqdHZy6s7jHGqZOf0vDvebMdfIQqxKecaE390Wlkm4proo8VjbdOlU5HKnpeVE6qcRYGiKl95ymEW_5236WMWzA77p6gXSt3wXTAbez5eDVk3DcVYXmJ-3as77x5tsaCIBf2ClKXtVmOW0Civ7HWfmzSpgC388S4TnB1soOQlJverHs7yQ3cwaT5g2PuXSY8SLpvy8eD18_n6OoJy6sYc7ABVwv0J2ZjFYy2MM~].\nYou likely interact with data daily. With strong data analysis skills, you can\nbe more intentional about the way you receive, interpret, and share data. You\ncan:\n\n * Identify patterns to glean insights and enhance strategic decision-making\n * Quantify your impact with success metrics\n * Create compelling visualizations to share your results\n\nFor an introduction to data analysis and to hear examples of how it may already\nshow up in your life, we recommend watching the first lecture video\n[https://link.coursera.org/f/a/14Rc2eynzRCRb7hAbfpxzQ~~/AAQRxRA~/LnmsLx6cH2KKHpywXIA42fnav14Jot5z-QCQ9D3gU02MA73WgT-SC5RXuaJg5FAhhGGhr1y138MgKVLyvHanXZHOusQmObBOo7RhgxrKAcNMmYfKDWP-iM3zr-NacwuBV_kzae7EIGVdsVAZKwKicgu-qszKwC-n4CzCRg_wN_C1uiWVrN7Cht4yNvmLVEH48nCvHgUt76K59Lwy856p8cUi4gSR5jYjahIsM5XwQ9GgxMISIQChtFtMHwZxhP_dtvlPMQTyPUofswOZiI0RnvoEK-8aQWILQzz0kkBIjsztK_fAKAXsFOIt5dkIk-CpNpyhmKZnN-jfcAzTED2kpqEDVbB3RqzlCl9LWIK8TjiEmLzjOvPQkCtHe82MSNwsSvAj9zAXBeLC_tPgO49N-Q~~] in\nGoogle’s Data Analytics Professional Certificate.\n\nBecome a Data Analyst\n[https://link.coursera.org/f/a/lsgAkFitUg-idT3nk2SfzA~~/AAQRxRA~/DM0lU95aRksi1C5d3KjMkiTFCrsik1FU_tpi48MsoPsIy9CbYH-iOq18FaUY6u1h60kTZ9mIMESymaQD9lHe-5cu4tFzYhO8y-Dk9rYCXqY4DRm28aWJ8IWQDsyfQ79qNseJx5RnzOytNZEhWW_YB76JrHipzL0EWePa7RKMQpVOdS_3SdyQgcbh6PoJugvtXYe6Ma-mDUk13tH4zvRXGPjiqAeykywsWWyE_rB7-VDTmUNs12Nde5d6XoEJB416svuQxXQwd3HH8gi5bLl-mFx3wHOCVDcoBpR2h7AR6PuaZ3QrRYL-5d2PIyTDfM4ETkdMr7djn20QGpSFzVOeSg~~]\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\nWHERE TO BEGIN\n\n\n\nIf you’re new to data analysis, learn the basics in Google’s Foundations: Data,\nData, Everywhere\n[https://link.coursera.org/f/a/hkSeKmv3UY2oDRRUgcbdAg~~/AAQRxRA~/_fBz9PbHdU3yrYLetUMfYkKcZ6ezAs--QATyiNkVcOfRo_cFqnIHJQIlGp43HyV7t8qsbwdXLumOkTv6WhcQ6B_VpHQrGjtSHsab7TQhimSHyxxZ41-SpkLC-XVQMv2T2na7rJjVQlzI8Ipak5mj9rzm9K6ovvI2oJmmh06m9spSRRU-2DlUztfA90ELZjodllxxNZPcDe2Z59RVb2g1GTrIcSkvIZNpDnhl6uWpNHwZtwrELqJEj5O5BEhefUSpAXIRCa1SDd-cERVgad8BEAFneDCAT8ExSf8sGcVCcC9J75ffHPVICjPZD4_J-8Uu].\nIf you enjoy it, you can advance through the Google Data Analytics Professional\nCertificate.\n\nReady to deepen your skills? Explore these popular data analysis courses—all\nincluded with a Coursera Plus subscription\n[https://link.coursera.org/f/a/E_jmmTMhOm4i3tXcLrRr8A~~/AAQRxRA~/IjQsOmv5djmPd3Z1MgqzoMyZP9GxveXFOEkfTfDsE6ZjS3w5D8NYpOBZWhq297qRSJC9y0uVJkOCn2YOOopSWDI-zV4ZLAhJ6o0FCHXFddp6wIHue8xHMqxy9aRhKymM0fr0Yhr1lY2Xk6keJeQdV1A8W6X1i6KWf0JHNMNhjgMinz07v9eKH7VQU582cKJjVbBHLk2cxCMpxPDoLvdtPgwVlZjM_dtQcq4I5sW5gCROr2J93GSqu1Pgj5NIpJrYoNnSGMpGYBLQuBn4WVTR3N4GsAXvl6g9SnJpya6noEtQP7unMl8hZpL4aLPCgJws]:\n\n\n\n[https://d3njjcbhbojbot.cloudfront.net/api/utilities/v1/imageproxy/https://coursera-misc.s3.amazonaws.com/mailspin/prod/07_08_2023_03_12_04_Screenshot_2023-07-07_at_8.11.44_PM.png?w=120&border=1,E5E7E8&border-radius=6,6,6,6&border-radius-inner=6,6,6,6&dpr=2]\nhttps://link.c