te_single_01-help-0-textfooterglimmer-null-icq8ji~mpd41p3l~jn-null-null&eid=icq8ji-mpd41p3l-jn&otpToken=MTMwNDFlZTkxNTI5YzljMmJjMjgwZmViNDExOWVlYjY4ZGNhZDA0MzlmYWI4NjYyN2JjZjA1Njc0NzU5NTRmYmYwZDBkM2U5NjRkM2M2ZjgwMWZlZmI5MjBlMzQzMjI3ZWQzZDc1MzAxMmZhYmQyMWI3YzBhYjIwLDEsMQ%3D%3D\n\n© 2026 LinkedIn Corporation, 1zwnj000 West Maude Avenue, Sunnyvale, CA 94085.\nLinkedIn and the LinkedIn logo are registered trademarks of LinkedIn.','incoming-complaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('a9feed99-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dear Abhinav Parmar,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"I want to connect\".\n\nYour reference ID is #d69e6b3d. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('aa0322e8-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'RESUME WORDED [https://resumeworded.com/assets/images/resume-worded-logo.png]\n\nYashica,\n\nIt\'s been a couple months since you checked your resume on Resume Worded.\n\nLooking back at your background: Your CS engineering background at IIIT\nJabalpur, packed with full-stack projects like HobbyNet and browser automation\ntools, opens a lot of doors: you could dive into full-stack development, pivot\nto AI/ML with your Gemini API work, or even lead tech teams given your mentoring\nand hackathon wins. That\'s awesome.\n\nThat\'s a lot of directions you could go. But the harder question is — do you\nknow which one actually fits you?\n\nA few things worth thinking about:\n\n• Do you want to stick with hands-on full-stack building like your HobbyNet PERN\nstack, or lean more into AI tools like Productivity Pro\'s Gemini integration?\n• With your Playwright automation and hackathon leadership, are you eyeing\nindividual contributor roles in dev, or something with more team mentoring like\nyour BitByte work?\n• Sounds like you\'re strong in both frontend React and backend Node.js, so do\nyou prefer versatile full-stack positions, or specializing in one like AI-driven\nextensions?\n\nMost people don\'t have clear answers to these. But it\'d really help to have them\n— at least you\'d know what your north star is and what the path looks like to\nget there.\n\nOne thing that\'s helped friends and people I\'ve worked with is the Coached\npersonality test [https://coached.com]. Most tests just tell you \"you\'re an\nINTJ\" and leave it there. Coached actually shows you what you\'re naturally\nsuited to, what types of companies and roles fit you, and gives you the language\nto explain it. It\'s why it\'s gotten so popular.\n\nIt\'s free and takes about 15 minutes.\n\nTake the Coached Test [https://coached.com]\n\nAnd if you\'re actively working on your resume — Pro makes sure it actually\nreflects what you\'re going for.\n\nGet Pro at 75% OFF\n[https://resumeworded.com/buy-pro?ccde=R1W21RW15&utm_source=email&utm_medium=monthly-checkin&utm_campaign=variant-2]\n\n— Kim\n\nKim [https://resumeworded.com/assets/images/kimberley-tyler-smith.png] Kimberley\nTyler-Smith\nSenior Resume Expert and Ex-Hiring Manager, Resume Worded\n\nNot helpful? Unsub instantly\n[https://resumeworded.com/workers/unsub-user-everywhere?requestType=unsubscribe_from_reminder_emails&email_to_unsub=loharyashica%40gmail.com&authcode=c54197b3052585e2ab91cd7ea4ab6922]\n\n[https://ea.pstmrk.it/open?m=v3_1.BAlWnVhZH_Xkj1C7HkEjGg.vlaVm6IBSdnNB1hIOzEpZGiX0H37nDqsHW7R6j8cqt1Nfr5kiEpLI2EdfOrIrCUd2af_bRNu0tac0PtkYbHLa7bRGIVVV67CI5VokstBT9Y6CmgWEVouOsrOWmzc-Wv3fNO8h3qqjJqunW987k7I2sbapVzqwxqVMCDcYDT2yRgSiXhylQavb05dGA__m555s_moN38mCNuQLXlTQm5JXrFE7gfQhbEBAaJBdJxiOa8vJXbfSzef8bS3jHrhfNulKvi7NlExBcsc9clDPBulWYRPwxBmc1-UCn0LvwgFflcPrvIggfqkTrNoluyv2q2LH_cPL27vUpfkWjqsyNWiHmPV1yLH3vIiN9jrokw_znvz1De8-KRuRi5jhq8t5jYBNABBCE9NIgJrx2NBupzCFhFJXTgVGX2bSUhWgHWIjH19Z5skFovYMO7sZiGgpKK5MKoQl2bhd-lLOUyuJ4Qxy5HSewNDTNvs-8HG860pCS5kaS