n stocks since my decision was torn between FD and Stocks. The spe \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE1NTc2Nzg5MzU3MDU2OTAzMDl8M3wxfDE0Nzc3NDM4OTUxNTcyMzAifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=mQFYzvRjQUx&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=3&et=2&id=1b91d566b91e412fbe130ad6d5546f37&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: My daughter wants a cucumber. What should I do?\n\n\nAnswer from Wilson Nathalie\n\n\nGive her the cucumber. Wash it first. Hand it over. That is it. It is a vegetable, not a dilemma. If she eats it, great. If she plays with it, also fine. If she tries to r \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE1NTc2Nzg5MzU3MDU2OTAzMDl8NHwxfDE0Nzc3NDM5MDY0MDI2NjgifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=MLh0wfPXpZF&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=4&et=2&id=1b91d566b91e412fbe130ad6d5546f37&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\n\n\nMy husband 40M, me 30F have been married for 2 years. He\'s the perfect husband anyone can wish for, he takes care of the bills 100 percent, he helps with chores, he treats me kindly without being aske...\n\n\n\nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE1NTc2Nzg5MzU3MDU2OTAzMDl8NXwxMHwyNDY4NjEwNDcifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=VLXxAj5fiPa&aoty=4&aty=4&cp=5&et=2&id=1b91d566b91e412fbe130ad6d5546f37&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n\n-----\nQuestion: I faked my high school transcripts and got accepted into a prestigious university. I also got a full scholarship. I really want to go but I’m so worried I’ll get caught. I need my transcripts verified. What should I do?\n\n\nAnswer from Alice Baker\n\n\nLidiya, there is no such thing as a real university that would accept your application and offer you a full scholarship on the basis of a faked high school transcript. Tha \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE1NTc2Nzg5MzU3MDU2OTAzMDl8NnwxfDE0Nzc3NDM2NzE4OTQ5ODUifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=LmSpcBKLNFT&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=6&et=2&id=1b91d566b91e412fbe130ad6d5546f37&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: Do you wear underwear under your saree?\n\n\nAnswer from Jayashri\n\n\nFirst understand saree as a typical Indian garment should be worn the Indian way which is best fit for the climate of the land.\n\nAs a person who was wearing half-saree fro \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE1NTc2Nzg5MzU3MDU2OTAzMDl8N3wxfDE0Nzc3NDM4OTg3ODEzMjUifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=1bmddO8QNe4&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=7&et=2&id=1b91d566b91e412fbe130ad6d5546f37&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: If a police officer asks you to step out of the car for questioning, is it legal for you to refuse?\n\n\nAnswer from Dennis Manning\n\n\nThe Supreme Court has ruled that an officer can ask you to step out of the car for their own personal safety.\n\nThe side benefit is that when you are out of the car, it wil \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE1NTc2Nzg5MzU3MDU2OTAzMDl8OHwxfDE0Nzc3NDM4OTM5NzA2MjgifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=8GyKs2F8m2P&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=8&et=2&id=1b91d566b91e412fbe130ad6d5546f37&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: As a non-Muslim, have you met a five-time praying Muslim? How do they behave? How did they treat you?\n\n\nAnswer from Sangeetha Sriraam\n\n\nMy LLM roommate was a devote Muslim. She prayed five-times a day, kept fast during Ramadaan, and went to Hajj twice. She was also a hardcore non-vegetarian.\n\nI, on the oth \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE1NTc2Nzg5MzU3MDU2OTAzMDl8OXwxfDgxMDQyMDM5In0%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=d8SBdcIoNUD&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=9&et=2&id=1b91d566b91e412fbe130ad6d5546f37&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\n\n\nZODIACS RANKED BY WHO IS MENTALLY STRONG\n1st: SCORPIO ♏ - Unbreakable mindset\n2nd: CAPRICORN ♑ - Built for pressure\n3rd: AQUARIUS ♒ - Emotionally detached\n4th: VIRGO ♍ - Logic over chaos\n5th: TAURUS ♉...\n\n\n\nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE1NTc2Nzg5MzU3MDU2OTAzMDl8MTB8MTB8MjQ3ODEwMzUzIn0%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=FqKYCXvzHQH&aoty=4&aty=4&cp=10&et=2&id=1b91d566b91e412fbe130ad6d5546f37&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n\n-----\nQuestion: How do people earning 60-70 LPA in India typically manage their finances to save and invest effectively?\n\n\nAnswer from Rams V\n\n\nI earn more than the 70LPA for last few years and frankly my lifestyle haven’t changed drastically apart from staying in a premium gated community solely because it made s \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE1NTc2Nzg5MzU3MDU2OTAzMDl8MTF8MXwxNDc3NzQzOTA1NDU0ODM2In0%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=VAWeyj3MD8D&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=11&et=2&id=1b91d566b91e412fbe130ad6d5546f37&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: I got selected in TCS Ninja. What will be my salary and designation after 8-10 years at TCS?\n\n\nAnswer from Raghav Dua\n\n\nFirst of all congratulations of being selected in TCS as TCS Ninja.\n\nSince you joins TCS as TCS Ninja. So, your CTC will be around 3.36 LPA and your designation is Assista \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE1NTc2Nzg5MzU3MDU2OTAzMDl8MTJ8MXwxNDc3NzQzNzY1MDk0MTk2In0%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=F24RkBRzjdF&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=12&et=2&id=1b91d566b91e412fbe130ad6d5546f37&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\n\n-----\n\nTo control which emails we send you, visit: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?aoid&aoty=14&aty=4&cp=0&et=2&id=1b91d566b91e412fbe130ad6d5546f37&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n\nTo unsubscribe from this type of email, visit: https://www.quora.com/email_optout/qemail_unsubscribe?email_track_id=1b91d566b91e412fbe130ad6d5546f37&t=1779246968558515&token=364470f620a2a1e84f49cbb0514cfafffaf6c0cb36816deaa8a00364d93ec57a804e9b903e68a825d22389c33982bec71db4ecf02dc80622ec75351b78f53b08&type=2&uid=1952091097','incoming-complaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('aa13d093-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dear Quora Digest,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"JEE 2026 - FAILED\".\n