\n\n\nNote: This API change has not been released yet. This message is an early notice to help you prepare. The change will take effect on June 4, 2026. If your application simply renders the provided URL and does not perform strict string comparisons or domain validation, this breaking change is unlikely to affect you, and no action is required.\n\n\n\n\n\nView Trending Search Documentation [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7sR&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hyV50Ts&]\n\n\n\n\nTrack Crypto Prices 24/7\n\n\n\n\nDownload the CoinGecko Mobile App on Google Play [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/e943fcfe-30ee-4388-a996-7c7864f74b9d.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7sl&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hQ1eF6v&]\n\n\nDownload the CoinGecko Mobile App on App Store [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/94ec33ad-c2f1-44ce-8715-db61dc346689.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7sM&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hCdOa7x&]\n\n\n\n\n\nVisit our Twitter page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/twitter4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7sI&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hdXmyKa&]\n\nVisit our Instagram page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/instagram4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7sK&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=h4rwPmK&]\n\nVisit our YouTube page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/youtube4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7sA&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hF2YsiE&]\n\nVisit our Telegram page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/telegram4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7sX&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=h4Xk2CI&]\n\nVisit our Facebook 