am! 👑💻\nAs a registered participant of ICPC AlgoQueen 2026, you are getting exclusive access to a special speaker session designed to help you strengthen your competitive programming and problem-solving journey. 🚀\nWe are excited to invite you to our upcoming expert session:\n🎤 Speaker: Jaskaran Singh\n💼 Software Engineer at Google\n📚 Topic: Mastering CP\n📅 Date: 23rd May 2026\n⏰ Time: 6:00 PM – 7:00 PM\n🔗 Session Link: https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_ZmNmZjk1NmItZDkxOS00NmFlLThkMmMtZDAwNGVjMzliYWQ4%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%222d54890f-18e3-4c70-97cd-bc1e5f21f9cb%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%226a8f634b-c0bc-4e95-b92f-4aa117d19d3b%22%7d\nThis session is a great opportunity to learn from an experienced industry professional and gain insights into competitive programming, coding practices, and problem-solving strategies.\n✨ As part of AlgoQueen 2026, participants will also receive access to 10+ upcoming expert sessions featuring industry professionals, mentors, and experienced programmers.\n📲 Follow our official social media page for updates and announcements: @icpc_amrita_ on Instagram<https://www.instagram.com/icpc_amrita_/>\n👉 Event Registration & Details: ICPC AlgoQueen 2026 Official Website<https://algoqueen.icpc.global/>\nFor any queries, feel free to contact us at algoqueen@cb.amrita.edu<mailto:algoqueen@cb.amrita.edu>.\nWe look forward to seeing you at the session! 🚀\nBest regards,\nICPC AlgoQueen Team 2026\nAmrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham | ICPC Foundation.\n[Amrita University]\nDisclaimer: The information transmitted in this email, including attachments, is intended only for the person(s) or entity to which it is addressed and may contain confidential and/or privileged material. Any review, retransmission, dissemination or other use of, or taking of any action in reliance upon this information by persons or entities other than the intended recipient is prohibited. Any views expressed in any message are those of the individual sender and may not necessarily reflect the views of Amrita Vishwa Vidyapeetham. If you received this in error, please contact the sender and destroy any copies of this information.\n','incoming-complaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('ab11cefd-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dear ICPC Amritapuri,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"Speaker Session – ICPC AlgoQueen 2026 | Mastering CP with Jaskaran Singh\".\n\nYour reference ID is #d69e6b3d. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('ab1d678f-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'To view this content, open the following URL in your browser: https://www.pinterest.com/email/click/?user_id=MTEwNTk4NTc1ODM5ODg0MDIyMw%3D%3D&od=dD0xZDdiMGM3MTA0ZTQ0YWZlOTNjMWFmMDdiNmJjZDg4YyZjPUhPTUVGRUVEX0RJR0VTVF9QSU5TJnM9MWQ3YjBjNzEwNGU0NGFmZTkzYzFhZjA3YjZiY2Q4OGMmbj04MDc2MTIyZDQ4YjQ0NzUzYmI1ODI4OTdiNjczZjM1YQ%3D%3D&target=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.pinterest.com%2Fsecure%2Fautologin%2F%3Fuser_id%3DMTEwNTk4NTc1ODM5ODg0MDIyMw%253D%253D%26od%3D8dPc2vVKnDwozrYti5O1BsPbHxU84%252BBARoJXQ2gj3ZrXJwxv7Irx9UwkzGTEAHxSBznXGyGpdGEV1XWB7M22vpFGYjr%252BzzJl8gM2Ra%252BjNFQxb87tEgMmj9g1IlymqPkY0Hrl0tBT1kzvN8%252Ft7RK9Rw%253D%253D%26next%3D%252F%253Futm_campaign%253Dhfdigestpins%2526e_t%253D1d7b0c7104e44afe93c1af07b6bcd88c%2526e_t_s%253Dcta%2526utm_source%253D31%2526utm_medium%253D2004\n\n\nPinterest\n\n651 Brannan Street, San Francisco, CA, 94107\n\n    Help Centre: https://www.pinterest.com/email/click/?user_id=MTEwNTk4NTc1ODM5ODg0MDIyMw%3D%3D&od=dD0xZDdiMGM3MTA0ZTQ0YWZlOTNjMWFmMDdiNmJjZDg4YyZjPUhPTUVGRUVEX0RJR0VTVF9QSU5TJnM9MWQ3YjBjNzEwNGU0NGFmZTkzYzFhZjA3YjZiY2Q4OGMmbj04MDc2MTIyZDQ4YjQ0NzUzYmI1ODI4OTdiNjczZjM1YQ%3D%3D&target=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.pinterest.com%2F_%2F_%2Fhelp%2F%3Fsource%3Demail_footer%26utm_campaign%3Dhfdige