l, it deserves to be seen. Submit it and then share it on your social media platforms tagging @withcoral and @WeMakeDevs.\n\n\n[ **SUBMIT PROJECT**](https://gcgb7.r.ag.d.sendibm3.com/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2nfy8RRvErhE5ys73kqrHJ2f/1fRdiAYRrHD0)\n\n\n**WeMakeDevs**\n\n\n128, City Road, EC1V 2NX, London\n\n\nThis email was sent to loharyashica@gmail.com.\n\nYou\'ve received this email because you\'ve subscribed to our newsletter.\n\n\n[Unsubscribe](https://gcgb7.r.ag.d.sendibm3.com/mk/un/v2/sh/7nVTPdbLJ2bPbSf7wq7r1IrEfYe2bg9/9J-bcPiDD95w)\n\n','incoming-complaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('acd512d5-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dear WeMakeDevs,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"Tomorrow is the Last Day, Submit NOW!\".\n\nYour reference ID is #d69e6b3d. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('acdcd662-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'To view this content, open the following URL in your browser: https://www.pinterest.com/email/click/?user_id=MTEwNTk4NTc1ODM5ODg0MDIyMw%3D%3D&od=dD00NzAzYTBhOGM3YzQ0NTJhYThjNDAyODAxNDIyZTE5YyZjPUhPTUVGRUVEX0RJR0VTVF9QSU5TJnM9NDcwM2EwYThjN2M0NDUyYWE4YzQwMjgwMTQyMmUxOWMmbj0wMDA5NmI0MDkyZWM0OGM1YjNiMjg2MGNmOTIwNjJlZg%3D%3D&target=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.pinterest.com%2Fsecure%2Fautologin%2F%3Fuser_id%3DMTEwNTk4NTc1ODM5ODg0MDIyMw%253D%253D%26od%3D76MKbo0lMW8x4kYGDySqgmFNSYxmSw6ha6FrbYMrfl96yCVDwkrfvIjyOQYJX9IT0GlVARlSQ36RoAONOkUbCzVJUW5A8WDuvGXP6SeIuB43z3AsSoYcE9Cqq8iq5ABwNxyI2DhtsLn5PJ29B7xu0A%253D%253D%26next%3D%252F%253Futm_campaign%253Dhfdigestpins%2526e_t%253D4703a0a8c7c4452aa8c402801422e19c%2526e_t_s%253Dcta%2526utm_source%253D31%2526utm_medium%253D2004\n\n\nPinterest\n\n651 Brannan Street, San Francisco, CA, 94107\n\n    Help Centre: https://www.pinterest.com/email/click/?user_id=