o;border:0;width:100%\" width=\"650\" alt title height=\"auto\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"text_block block-2\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;word-break:break-word\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"pad\"><div style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><div class style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Arial,\'Helvetica Neue\',Helvetica,sans-serif;mso-line-height-alt:16.8px;color:#000;line-height:1.2\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;mso-line-height-alt:18px\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; color: #000000; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">Hey YashicaLohar,</span><br></span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"text_block block-3\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;word-break:break-word\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"pad\"><div style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><div class style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,\'Helvetica Neue\',Helvetica,sans-serif;mso-line-height-alt:14.399999999999999px;color:#000;line-height:1.2\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\">The internship season is around the corner, and we\'ve been receiving multiple requests for new courses. We heard you!\n<br><br>You now get full access to our <strong>Quant/HFT, Full Stack, and GenAI</strong> courses as part of NxtWave Launchpad. We\'re committed to building a true one-stop platform for your preparation. Thank you for your valuable feedback and suggestions, we truly appreciate hearing what you\'d like to see next.<br><br>\n<strong>Explore these courses here:</strong> <a href=\"https://c.webengage.com/lw/g1.jpg?p=eyJsYyI6In4xNWJhMjAxNTMiLCJsIjoiMWU5NjkzOTU5NWIzMDRmNDMzYTg1ZWMzN2Y1ZDU4MWI1MWZhYzQ3YiIsImMiOiJhNWY3NGM4Yy05NmM2LTQ2NTMtYTJiZC05ZDRjNWY2NzVkOTkiLCJlbSI6ImxvaGFyeWFzaGljYUBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJlIjoiMW4yNDZoMyIsInYiOiI1OGdpY2gzIiwicyI6IjRiNGE5NTEzLTk3MDItNDJjMS1iOWM5LTY5ZWYxMjc0MzJiMSIsImoiOiJ%2BaGg0a2duIiwiZXZlbnQiOiJlbWFpbF9jbGljayIsImN0YSI6ImM3ZTg2NTc3IiwidG9VUkwiOiJodHRwczovL2xlYXJuaW5nLmNjYnAuaW4vIn0%3D\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #2060e4;\" rel=\"noopener\">https://learning.ccbp.in/&nbsp;</a><br><br>Here are some additional resources to accelerate your preparation:<br><br>\n• <strong>DSA Sheet:</strong> <a href=\"https://c.webengage.com/lw/g1.jpg?p=eyJsYyI6In4xNWJhMjAxNTMiLCJsIjoiMWU5NjkzOTU5NWIzMDRmNDMzYTg1ZWMzN2Y1ZDU4MWI1MWZhYzQ3YiIsImMiOiJhNWY3NGM4Yy05NmM2LTQ2NTMtYTJiZC05ZDRjNWY2NzVkOTkiLCJlbSI6ImxvaGFyeWFzaGljYUBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJlIjoiMW4yNDZoMyIsInYiOiI1OGdpY2gzIiwicyI6IjRiNGE5NTEzLTk3MDItNDJjMS1iOWM5LTY5ZWYxMjc0MzJiMSIsImoiOiJ%2BaGg0a2duIiwiZXZlbnQiOiJlbWFpbF9jbGljayIsImN0YSI6ImEyOTRiYWJkIiwidG9VUkwiOiJodHRwczovL3Rpbnl1cmwuY29tL3l2eTZiZDJiIn0%3D\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #2060e4;\" rel=\"noopener\">https://tinyurl.com/yvy6bd2b</a>&nbsp;<br>• <strong>CP Ladder:</strong> <a href=\"https://c.webengage.com/lw/g1.jpg?p=eyJsYyI6In4xNWJhMjAxNTMiLCJsIjoiMWU5NjkzOTU5NWIzMDRmNDMzYTg1ZWMzN2Y1ZDU4MWI1MWZhYzQ3YiIsImMiOiJhNWY3NGM4Yy05NmM2LTQ2NTMtYTJiZC05ZDRjNWY2NzVkOTkiLCJlbSI6ImxvaGFyeWFzaGljYUBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJlIjoiMW4yNDZoMyIsInYiOiI1OGdpY2gzIiwicyI6IjRiNGE5NTEzLTk3MDItNDJjMS1iOWM5LTY5ZWYxMjc0MzJiMSIsImoiOiJ%2BaGg0a2duIiwiZXZlbnQiOiJlbWFpbF9jbGljayIsImN0YSI6ImFlNjBlZTA2IiwidG9VUkwiOiJodHRwczovL3Rpbnl1cmwuY29tL3loOWNrbnd0In0%3D\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #2060e4;\" rel=\"noopener\">https://tinyurl.com/yh9cknwt</a>&nbsp;<br><br>\nThese resources are designed to give you a structured path for your preparation. But resources alone aren\'t enough. The real challenge is staying consistent.<br><br>That\'s why we\'ve created dedicated WhatsApp communities where you\'ll receive daily problems, weekly contests, quizzes, and updates to help you stay on track throughout the placement season.<br><br>\n<strong>Join your college-specific community here:</strong> <a href=\"https://c.webengage.com/lw/g1.jpg?p=eyJsYyI6In4xNWJhMjAxNTMiLCJsIjoiMWU5NjkzOTU5NWIzMDRmNDMzYTg1ZWMzN2Y1ZDU4MWI1MWZhYzQ3YiIsImMiOiJhNWY3NGM4Yy05NmM2LTQ2NTMtYTJiZC05ZDRjNWY2NzVkOTkiLCJlbSI6ImxvaGFyeWFzaGljYUBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJlIjoiMW4yNDZoMyIsInYiOiI1OGdpY2gzIiwicyI6IjRiNGE5NTEzLTk3MDItNDJjMS1iOWM5LTY5ZWYxMjc0MzJiMSIsImoiOiJ%2BaGg0a2duIiwiZXZlbnQiOiJlbWFpbF9jbGljayIsImN0YSI6Ijg5MGM1NDRjIiwidG9VUkwiOiJodHRwczovL3Rpbnl1cmwuY29tLzQ0dHVqc2JyIn0%3D\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #2060e4;\" rel=\"noopener\">https://tinyurl.com/44tujsbr</a>&nbsp;<br><br>And there\'s more.<br><br>As you stay active on the platform, complete preparation milestones, and remain consistent with your learning, you\'ll unlock additional opportunities such as:<br><br>• Real OA questions from top companies<br>\n• Mock interviews and 1:1 guidance session with industry mentors<br><br>Stay tuned for the eligibility criteria announcement!<br><br>We\'re in this journey together. Let\'s crack your dream internship together.<br><br>Team NxtWave Launchpad</p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"row row-2\" align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td><table class=\"row-content stack\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;color:#000;width:650px;margin:0 auto\" width=\"650\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"column column-1\" width=\"100%\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;font-weight:400;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td class=