idToken=AQG-BFco0wt-tA&midSig=1zfTtWsxW3Qsg1&trk=eml-email_freemium_nba_recommendation_01-help-0-textfooterglimmer&trkEmail=eml-email_freemium_nba_recommendation_01-help-0-textfooterglimmer-null-icq8ji~mpz45x8i~bf-null-null&eid=icq8ji-mpz45x8i-bf\n\n© 2026 LinkedIn Corporation, 1zwnj000 West Maude Avenue, Sunnyvale, CA 94085.\nLinkedIn and the LinkedIn logo are registered trademarks of LinkedIn.','incoming-complaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('adbeb277-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dear LinkedIn,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"See hiring trends for HCLSoftware\".\n\nYour reference ID is #d69e6b3d. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('adff1f26-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'LinkedIn 360 l By GaryVee\n\nBy Gary Vaynerchuk\n\n\nBy Gary Vaynerchuk\n\n    \n    \n    Read this article on LinkedIn to join the conversation\nRead on LinkedIn\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/comm/pulse/why-youtube-shorts-content-more-important-than-ever-gary-vaynerchuk-s4oxe?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_series_follow_newsletter_02%3BMXrGjtB%2BQbiSsWAsjxEZlw%3D%3D&midToken=AQG-BFco0wt-tA&midSig=2WjyLqVCDdQYg1&trk=eml-email_series_follow_newsletter_02-null-0-read_more_banner_cta_&trkEmail=eml-email_series_follow_newsletter_02-null-0-read_more_banner_cta_-null-icq8ji~mpzp0a48~p9-null-null&eid=icq8ji-mpzp0a48-p9\n  \nYouTube Shorts might be the most important platform in the AI era If you’re a creator, influencer, entrepreneur, or brand, and you’re not posting consistently on YouTube Shorts, you’re missing a much bigger opportunity than many people realize. So many people are still thinking about Shorts as just another place to distribute content. That’s a mistake. There’s a lot of consumption happening on Shorts right now. It’s a beautiful partner to TikTok, Instagram Reels, and Facebook. At a bare minimum, all of your short-form content should be posted there. But that’s not the real reason I’m bullish, nor is it why I could not recommend more people to produce content for YouTube and YouTube Shorts. Creating content on YouTube and YouTube Shorts is a strategic step...the content on there will feed the results of AI inquiries your customers are going to do. YouTube Shorts has gone from fifth or sixth most important platform at VaynerMedia to potentially number one. Shorts Is More Than a Distribution Channel The reason I’m so bullish on YouTube and YouTube Shorts is what comes next: I believe Gemini is going to be a massive winner in the AI race, ad every piece of content you’re uploading to YouTube Shorts today is doing two things at once. First, it’s giving you access to a platform with enormous consumption and attention. Second, and more importantly, it’s making deposits into what I believe will become a future AEO battleground. A lot of people are still focused exclusively on social media distribution. They’re thinking about views, likes, followers, and engagement, but that’s not everything. You\'re Making Deposits Into the AI Ecosystem I’m increasingly thinking about discoverability in an AI-driven world. The creators and brands who are consistently publishing content into Google’s ecosystem today are building assets that may become extraordinarily valuable tomorrow. That’s why I think Shorts matters. It’s not just a social media platform. It’s potentially an investment into your future relevance within AI search, and that’s why I think so many people are underestimating it. The best part is that the barrier to entry is incredibly low. If you’re sitting on years of Instagram Reels, TikToks, Facebook videos, podcast clips, speaking engagements, interviews, or educational content, you don’t need to reinvent the wheel. At bare minimum, all of that content should be posted on YouTube Shorts. That’s step one. Step two is making slight adjustments. Maybe you tweak the post-production a bit. Maybe you change the supporting copy around the video to fit the platform better. Maybe you make the content a little more native to the way YouTube users consume information. But the key is that you actually post. The Barrier to Entry Is Almost Zero Far too many people are treating YouTube Shorts as optional, and I don’t see it that way. When I look at the future, I see a world where search, discovery, AI, and content become increasingly connected. I want creators and brands making deposits today instead of scrambling later. And for some people, the answer may be even more aggressive than that. Could some creators go all in on Shorts and spend less time worrying about highly produced long-form video? Absolutely. I’ve always been the king of “both-and,” not “either-or.” Long-form content matters. Short-form content matters. TikTok matters. Instagram matters. Facebook matters. YouTube matters. The people who win tend to be the people willing to distribute everywhere attention exists. That’s why I keep coming back to the same point: If you’re already creating content, YouTube Shorts shouldn’t be an afterthought. It should be a standard part of your strategy. By posting to YouTube Shorts regularly, you’re capturing attention today, and you may be building discoverability for a future that most people haven’t fully recognized yet.\nKeep reading on LinkedIn\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/comm/pulse/why-youtube-shorts-content-more-important-than-ever-gary-vaynerchuk-s4oxe?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_series_follow_newsletter_02%3BMXrGjtB%2BQbiSsWAsjxEZlw%3D%3D&midToken=AQG-BFco0wt-tA&midSig=2WjyLqVCDdQYg1&trk=eml-email_series_follow_newsletter_02-newsletter_content_preview_text-0-readmore_button_&trkEmail=eml-email_series_follow_newsletter_02-newsletter_content_preview_text-0-readmore_button_-null-icq8ji~mpzp0a48~p9-null-null&eid=icq8ji-mpzp0a48-p9\n  \n      \n\n----------------------------------------\n\nThis email was intended for Yashica Lohar (Flipkart GWC 7.0 Scholar | CSE ’28 @ IIIT Jabalpur | 2 ⭐ @Codechef)\nLearn why we included this: https://www.linkedin.com/help/linkedin/answer/4788?lang=en&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_series_follow_newsletter_02%3BMXrGjtB%2BQbiSsWAsjxEZlw%3D%3D&midToken=AQG-BFco0wt-tA&midSig=2WjyLqVCDdQYg1&trk=eml-email_series_follow_newsletter_02-SecurityHelp-0-textfooterglimmer&trkEmail=eml-email_series_follow_newsletter_02-SecurityHelp-0-textfooterglimmer-null-icq8ji~mpzp0a48~p9-null-null&eid=icq8ji-mpzp0a48-p9\nYou are receiving LinkedIn notification emails. Others can see that you are a subscriber.\n\n\nUnsubscribe: https://www.linkedin.com/series-notifications/?action=unsubscribe&memberToken=ADoAAEIlwb4B7wSObgzu320aKxhPrfHhU2UtxwY&newsletterId=6641420720876343296&newsletterTitle=LinkedIn 360 l By GaryVee&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_series_follow_newsletter_02%3BMXrGjtB%2BQbiSsWAsjxEZlw%3D%3D&midToken=AQG-BFco0wt-tA&midSig=2WjyLqVCDdQYg1&ek=email_series_follow_newsletter_02&e=icq8ji-mpzp0a48-p9&eid=icq8ji-mpzp0a48-p9&m=unsubscribe&ts=footerGlimmer&li=0&t=plh    ·  Help: https://www.linkedin.com/help/linkedin/answer/67?lang=en&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_series_follow_newsletter_02%3BMXrGjtB%2BQbiSsWAsjxEZlw%3D%3D&midToken=AQG-BFco0wt-tA&midSig=2WjyLqVCDdQYg1&trk=eml-email_series_follow_newsletter_02-help-0-textfooterglimmer&trkEmail=eml-email_series_follow_newsletter_02-help-0-textfooterglimmer-null-icq8ji~mpzp0a48~p9-null-null&eid=icq8ji-mpzp0a48-p9\n\n© 2026 LinkedIn Corporation, 1zwnj000 West Maude Avenue, Sunnyvale, CA 94085.\nLinkedIn and the LinkedIn logo are registered trademarks of LinkedIn.','incoming-complaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('adffc8bd-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dear LinkedIn 360 l By GaryVee,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"Why YouTube Shorts Content Is More Important Than Ever\".\n\nYour reference ID is #d69e6b3d. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('ae05d894-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'To view this content, open the following URL in your browser: https://www.pinterest.com/email/click/?user_id=MTEwNTk4NTc1ODM5ODg0MDIyMw%3D%3D&od=dD01NDFmYzg5ZmJlYzA0NTI5OGIzNjZlM2Q1MzVkOWY2YSZjPUhPTUVGRUVEX0RJR0VTVF9QSU5TJnM9NTQxZmM4OWZiZWMwNDUyOThiMzY2ZTNkNTM1ZDlmNmEmbj1jMjBlYzE4MTU1M2E0NTc3OTIzZTE1Y2JmMGI2MTRkMw%3D%3D&target=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.pinterest.com%2Fsecure%2Fautologin%2F%3Fuser_id%3DMTEwNTk4NTc1ODM5ODg0MDIyMw%253D%253D%26od%3DuJBuwBUnjeN2YICgFn8HcYBHhZFUCMWH917kRZyqlOe30fs%252B1IbAKqsXflA9txAQ65KJkFgvv%252BlUWmkdLW3kWF%252BX40QSP0D2XN0SUNwnvRzSPB8ZSvJsd%252FdxxSzPnelbg2Vk3fNLpphteJWyrZ1ckw%253D%253D%26next%3D%252F%253Futm_campaign%253Dhfdigestpins%2526e_t%253D541fc89fbec045298b366e3d535d9f6a%2526e_t_s%253Dcta%2526utm_source%253D31%2526utm_medium%253D2004\n\n\nPinterest\n\n651 Brannan Street, San Francisco, CA, 94107\n\n    Help Centre: https://www.pinterest.com/email/click/?user_id=MTEwNTk4NTc1ODM5ODg0MDIyMw%3D%3D&od=dD01NDFmYzg5ZmJlYzA0NTI5OGIzNjZlM2Q1MzVkOWY2YSZjPUhPTUVGRUVEX0RJR0VTVF9QSU5TJnM9NTQxZmM4OWZiZWMwNDUyOThiMzY2ZTNkNTM1ZDlmNmEmbj1jMjBlYzE4MTU1M2E0NTc3OTIzZTE1Y2JmMGI2MTRkMw%3D%3D&target=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.pinterest.com%2F_%2F_%2Fhelp%2F%3Fsource%3Demail_footer%26utm_campaign%3Dhfdigestpins%26e_t%3D541fc89fbec045298b366e3d535d9f6a%26e_t_s%3Dfooter%26utm_source%3D31%26utm_medium%3D2004\n\n    Privacy Policy: https://www.pinterest.com/email/click/?user_id=MTEwNTk4NTc1ODM5ODg0MDIyMw%3D%3D&od=dD01NDFmYzg5ZmJlYzA0NTI5OGIzNjZlM2Q1MzVkOWY2YSZjPUhPTUVGRUVEX0RJR0VTVF9QSU5TJnM9NTQxZmM4OWZiZWMwNDUyOThiMzY2ZTNkNTM1ZDlmNmEmbj1jMjBlYzE4MTU1M2E0NTc3OTIzZTE1Y2JmMGI2MTRkMw%3D%3D&target=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.pinterest.com%2F_%2F_%2Fpolicy%2Fprivacy-p