dress: https://pages.wandb.ai/index.php/email/emailWebview?mkt_tok=MjYxLVFIUC04MjIAAAGiM4hjUFNUHpsZD10A_r3U1yrbt9I78H59CRetwiWrGkgDDXaXf-H-7bCiyBaCPhLqSYbZy-IMLVbaukOOkgMdKOOkAfHnUK_flda-rsdTPQ\n\nJune 04, 2026\n\nHey all, we are kicking off June with new ways to compare runs in W&B Models, agent observability and continuous improvement features in W&B Weave, and an in-person hack on June 6. As always, check out the Weights & Biases docs <https://email.wandb.ai/MjYxLVFIUC04MjIAAAGiM4hjUDkx_nDxaTfben2y4zXAXzxMuTmL-j5gSE5dzKFFyQyFOnLjuN35s_sM0WYOtb970ig=> for all the latest product details or sign up for the What’s New Wednesdays webinar series <https://email.wandb.ai/MjYxLVFIUC04MjIAAAGiM4hjUKKZBIKuNfHcMQzU-lGtt-JOUDzqNm2ospsUZz6SZXDj_NV_iH79EZu1KW75k8q2a6A=>.\nNew: Compare runs across projects in any W&B workspace\n\n\nNow pin runs from other projects in Workspaces <https://email.wandb.ai/MjYxLVFIUC04MjIAAAGiM4hjUAPRDlg3IDHaLY-vhUhYzHXuDwAqXD2TP17R0ruNplMBMDJGYpLGKXpJhh_etbNgrTg=> and view them on the same line plots as local runs. Useful for benchmarking a new approach against a baseline from another project, pulling scattered results into one view, and more.\nNew: Observability and continuous improvement for production agents in W&B Weave\n\nWe’ve rebuilt W&B Weave <https://email.wandb.ai/MjYxLVFIUC04MjIAAAGiM4hjUGlcSnqMUFVZanoK5Z90NanvrgBu7pAkvl9l0CrAc5kZmfJYrHLkv7PB9VEBxDwGnXw=> from the ground up to help production agents learn and improve continuously from real-world experience, so they can achieve and maintain reliability. Weave now provides end-to-end observability to monitor production agents, out-of-the-box signals to surface failure modes, a complete improvement loop from inference to training, and a flexible evaluation framework to prevent regressions. Try it for free. <https://email.wandb.ai/MjYxLVFIUC04MjIAAAGiM4hjUFVQLNEDpak32dEAoTVXGaB7DiX9cGYiVaHgpn1pWosiWjXDLEOeunv3IynzMIKklCU=>\nWeave hacks: Multi-Agent Orchestration Hackathon\n\n\nOn June 6, come to the Weights & Biases SF office (400 Alabama Street) for the most fun you\'ll have this year building self-improving agents at Weave Hacks 4 <https://email.wandb.ai/MjYxLVFIUC04MjIAAAGiM4hjUIJPiRY3nBjHo_z5XGiNRzPDIwFNMF16-OYwhAjLCLYEKnQfYYhwJ4wrhmsZI_Ys4xA=>. This time, we’re focused on orchestrating pipelines and wrangling swarms.\nUntil next time,\nThe Weights & Biases Team\nWeights & Biases, 400 Alabama Street, Suite 202, San Francisco, CA 94110, 2026\n\nUnsubscribe <[[https://pages.wandb.ai/UnsubscribePage.html?mkt_unsubscribe=1&mkt_tok=MjYxLVFIUC04MjIAAAGiM4hjUFNUHpsZD10A_r3U1yrbt9I78H59CRetwiWrGkgDDXaXf-H-7bCiyBaCPhLqSYbZy-IMLVbaukOOkgMdKOOkAfHnUK_flda-rsdTPQ]]>\n','incoming-complaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('ae0f3754-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dear Weights & Biases,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"Production agent observability, run comparisons, & hack on June 6\".\n\nYour reference ID is #d69e6b3d. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('ae185bf8-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Father’s Day is on 21 June. Shop the latest iPhone, AirPods and more. ͏⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌