ortant}.social_block .social-table{display:inline-block!important } } \n</style><!--[if mso ]><style>sup, sub { font-size: 100% !important; } sup { mso-text-raise:10% } sub { mso-text-raise:-10% }</style> <![endif]--></head><body class=\"body\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;text-size-adjust:none;background-color:#fff\"><table class=\"nl-container\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;background-color:#fff\"><tbody><tr><td><table class=\"row row-1\" align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td><table class=\"row-content stack\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;color:#000;width:600px;margin:0 auto\" width=\"600\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"column column-1\" width=\"100%\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;font-weight:400;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"col-pad\" style=\"padding-bottom:5px;padding-top:5px\"><table class=\"image_block block-1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"width:100%\" align=\"center\"><div style=\"max-width:600px\"><img src=\"https://efiles.webengage.com/cdn-cgi/image/q=70/images/we15ba20153/nxtwave%20launchpad%20email%20banner.png\" style=\"display:block;height:auto;border:0;width:100%\" width=\"600\" alt title height=\"auto\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"text_block block-2\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;word-break:break-word\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"pad\"><div style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><div class style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Arial,\'Helvetica Neue\',Helvetica,sans-serif;mso-line-height-alt:16.8px;color:#000;line-height:1.2\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;mso-line-height-alt:18px\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; color: #000000; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">Hey YashicaLohar,</span><br></span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"text_block block-3\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;word-break:break-word\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"pad\"><div style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><div class style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,\'Helvetica Neue\',Helvetica,sans-serif;mso-line-height-alt:14.399999999999999px;color:#000;line-height:1.2\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\">\nWhen preparing for placements or internships, Dynamic Programming is one topic you cannot afford to skip. It consistently appears in Online Assessments and technical interviews across top product companies.<br><br>🚀 <strong>Enroll Now</strong>: <a href=\"https://c.webengage.com/lw/g1.jpg?\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #2060e4;\" rel=\"noopener\">https://tinyurl.com/3kw7b3ce</a>&nbsp;<br><br>\n<strong>Instructor</strong>: Anish De | SWE II @ Google | Ex-Microsoft<br>📅 <strong>Starts</strong>: 9th June<br>🎯 Free Access for NxtWave Launchpad Users<br><br><em>Note: Recordings will be available on the platform shortly after each live class.</em><br>.<br><strong>What You\'ll Learn</strong><br>&gt; DP Foundations &amp; State Design<br>&gt; Grid DP, String DP &amp; LCS<br>&gt; Knapsack &amp; DP on Stocks<br>&gt; LIS and Advanced DP Patterns<br>&gt; Interval DP &amp; MCM<br>&gt; Tree DP &amp; Graph DP<br>\n&gt; Bitmask DP<br>&gt; Digit DP<br>&gt; Interview-Focused DP Problem Solving<br><br><strong>Why This Sprint?</strong><br>Many students can understand a DP solution after seeing it but struggle to derive it on their own. This sprint is designed to help you build the thought process behind DP, not just memorize patterns.<br><br><strong>You\'ll get:</strong><br>✅ Live classes with experienced engineer\'s top companies like <strong>Google, Microsoft</strong> and more<br>\n✅ <strong>80+ curated DP problems</strong> across core and advanced topics<br>✅ <strong>Live assignments</strong> and guided practice after every session<br>✅ Exposure to patterns frequently asked in <strong>top-company OAs and interviews</strong><br>✅ Advanced topics like <strong>Tree DP, Bitmask DP, Digit DP, and Graph DP</strong><br><br>If you\'re aiming for strong internship opportunities or placement offers from top companies, now is the right time to strengthen your DP skills.</p></div>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"button_block block-4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"pad\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://c.webengage.com/lw/g1.jpg?%3D\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;\"><!--[if mso]>\n<v:roundrect xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" xmlns:w=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word\"  href=\"https://tinyurl.com/3kw7b3ce\"  style=\"height:38px;width:107px;v-text-anchor:middle;\" arcsize=\"11%\" fillcolor=\"#3AAEE0\">\n<v:stroke dashstyle=\"Solid\" weight=\"0px\" color=\"#3AAEE0\"/>\n<w:anchorlock/>\n<v:textbox inset=\"0px,0px,0px,0px\">\n<center dir=\"false\" style=\"color:#ffffff;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:14px\">\n<![endif]-->\n<span class=\"button\" style=\"background-color: #3AAEE0; border-bottom: 0px solid transparent; border-left: 0px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; border-right: 0px solid transparent; border-top: 0px solid transpar