re with a 1.0 GPA and no accomplishments in my life. What can I do over the next 3 years of high school to get into Harvard?\n\n\nAnswer from Peri Collins\n\n\n\n> I\'m a high school sophomore with a 1.0 GPA and no accomplishments in my life. What can I do over the next 3 years of high school to get into Harvard?\nI\'m going to give  \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE4ODU5NzI5NjYxNDk1MzA5NDl8NXwxfDE1ODY4OTU3MyJ9&al_pri=8&aoid=3IaG86NeVPT&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=5&et=2&id=23f1846a10254157bdbcda45f9a6d1b7&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: I caught my 13 year old daughter using pads for her period without my permission. What do I do now?\n\n\nAnswer from Marylyn Ketimo\n\n\nThis is a personal issue for me because of my own childhood. When I first got my period at the age of 10, my mom was not very understanding. We only had one bathroom at ho \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE4ODU5NzI5NjYxNDk1MzA5NDl8NnwxfDE0Nzc3NDM4OTc4MDA2MjEifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=qvPew3RPwb2&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=6&et=2&id=23f1846a10254157bdbcda45f9a6d1b7&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\nQuestion: How can I get glowing skin without using too many products?\n\n\nAnswer from Sargam Patel\n\n\nWithout using too many skin care products getting glowing skin naturally is possible following simple steps-\n\n1. Washing your face twice a day morning plus evening or nigh \nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE4ODU5NzI5NjYxNDk1MzA5NDl8N3wxfDE0Nzc3NDM5MDY5NDg5NTcifQ%3D%3D&al_pri=8&aoid=aXGMADOQBkr&aoty=1&aty=4&cp=7&et=2&id=23f1846a10254157bdbcda45f9a6d1b7&uid=YfxxO1ZRus7\n-----\n\n\nLost job. She divorced him. Filed fake cases. Took lakhs in alimony.\nHe rebuilt his life. Bought a Mercedes. Posted one photo.\nOne week later: legal notice for 2 crore more.\nNot \"maintenance.\" Not \"ne...\n\n\n\nRead More: https://www.quora.com/qemail/tc?al_imp=eyJ0eXBlIjogMzMsICJoYXNoIjogIjE4ODU5NzI5NjYxNDk1M