one;text-size-adjust:none;background-color:#fff\"><table class=\"nl-container\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;background-color:#fff\"><tbody><tr><td><table class=\"row row-1\" align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td><table class=\"row-content stack\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;color:#000;width:650px;margin:0 auto\" width=\"650\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"column column-1\" width=\"100%\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;font-weight:400;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"col-pad\" style=\"padding-bottom:5px;padding-top:5px\"><table class=\"image_block block-1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"width:100%\" align=\"center\"><div style=\"max-width:650px\"><img src=\"https://efiles.webengage.com/cdn-cgi/image/q=70/images/we15ba20153/nxtwave%20launchpad%20email%20banner.png\" style=\"display:block;height:auto;border:0;width:100%\" width=\"650\" alt title height=\"auto\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"text_block block-2\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;word-break:break-word\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"pad\"><div style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><div class style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:Arial,\'Helvetica Neue\',Helvetica,sans-serif;mso-line-height-alt:16.8px;color:#000;line-height:1.2\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;mso-line-height-alt:18px\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; color: #000000; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"word-break: break-word; font-size: 16px;\">Hey YashicaLohar,</span><br></span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"text_block block-3\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;word-break:break-word\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"pad\"><div style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><div class style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,\'Helvetica Neue\',Helvetica,sans-serif;mso-line-height-alt:14.399999999999999px;color:#000;line-height:1.2\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;mso-line-height-alt:19.2px\">\nPlacements and internships are won through consistent practice, and there\'s no better way to prepare than solving questions that closely mirror real Online Assessments.<br><br>The <strong>Week 3 Mock OA Contests</strong> are now live for registration!<br><br><strong>Advanced Contest (Friday)</strong><br>📅 Date: 12th June 2026(Tomorrow)<br>⏰ Time: 10PM - 12AM<br>\n🔗 Register Now <em><strong>(Just 1 day left!):</strong></em>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://c.webengage.com/lw/g1.jpg?%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #2060e4;\" rel=\"noopener\">https://tinyurl.com/mut6rmz6</a>&nbsp;<br><br><em>Challenge yourself with a curated set of previous-year OA-style questions designed to help you prepare for top company assessments.</em><br><br><strong>Beginner Contest (Saturday)</strong><br>📅 Date: 13th June 2026<br>⏰ Time: 3PM - 5PM\n<br>🔗 Register Now: <a href=\"https://c.webengage.com/lw/g1.jpg?%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #2060e4;\" rel=\"noopener\">https://tinyurl.com/479yka25</a>&nbsp;<br><br>Perfect for building confidence and strengthening your problem-solving fundamentals through placement-relevant questions.<br><br>Why Participate?<br>✅ Practice with previous-year OA-style questions<br>✅ Experience a real assessment environment<br>\n✅ Improve speed, accuracy, and problem-solving skills<br>✅ Identify strengths and areas to improve before actual placements<br><br>We look forward to seeing you on the leaderboard!<br><br>Best Regards,<br>Team NxtWave Launchpad</p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"row row-2\" align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><table class=\"row-content stack\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;color:#000;width:650px;margin:0 auto\" width=\"650\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"column column-1\" width=\"100%\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;font-weight:400;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"col-pad\" style=\"padding-bottom:5px;padding-top:5px\"><table class=\"divider_block block-1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"pad\" align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"divider_inner\" style=\"font-size:1px;line-height:1px;border-top:1px solid #bbb\">\n<span style=\"word-break: break-word;\"> </span></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"social_block block-2\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"pad\" align=\"center\"><table class=\"social-table\" wid