01031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Get automated updates for key market & metadata changes‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ \n\nIntroducing CoinGecko\'s Demo API Keyed Plan [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/d1c416bd-00e7-41d2-b8e3-34b4399204c8.png]\n\n\nHi Geckos 👋\n\n\nCoinGecko API now supports three native data delivery methods: pull on-demand data viaREST, stream sub-second market data viaWebSocket, and receive automated push notifications viaWebhooks(available on Analyst plans and above).\n\n\nInstead of constantly polling for updates, our new event-driven crypto Webhooks deliver updates exactly when a data change event occurs.\n\n\n\nReceive Instant Coin Metadata Updates\n\n\nThecg.coin.info.updated [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fs&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hPlUy86&]webhook event triggers the moment a coin\'s core metadata changes. You receive a payload detailing exactly what was updated across names, symbols, logos, contract addresses, categories, and public notices.\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/4314d3ff-c97b-4a8d-8454-1eeb1890c9f9.png]\n\n\nWhat Can You Build With Webhooks?\n\n\nTelegram & Discord Alert Bots\nSend automated notification messages directly to your community channels as soon as a tracked project updates its official website, GitHub, social media links, or gets added to a category.\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/1a51aa53-77b4-422c-b15d-02729ae3c836.gif]\n\nExchange & Wallet UI Syncing\nKeep your backend database automatically synced when a coin\'s ticker, logo, or category changes to prevent broken frontend workflows for exchanges, wallets, swaps, and crypto accounting tools.\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/5bd0f1bc-528b-4b44-80c0-ad4a2a5604d4.gif]\n\nSecurity & Compliance Monitoring\nAct instantly when critical alerts trigger, such as security breach notices or smart contract migration announcements.\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/142e3de1-60c1-4879-b85f-8d7ac150452a.gif]\n\nCross-Chain Contract Monitoring\nDetect exactly when an existing project deploys on a new blockchain or migrates to a new smart contract address.\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/b9a733b1-dc20-4039-b2a1-b828aafe37ca.gif]\n\nAutonomous AI Agents\nTrigger AI agents and trading bots to execute reasoning workflows exactly when a market event happens, replacing the need for a constant polling heartbeat.\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/7f1cbbe6-1c6b-4f70-b7f2-5d504d7d2d3c.png]\n\n\nExplore Webhook Documentation [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fy&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=h0hhQ8B&]\n\n\nComing Soon: Price & New Listing Webhooks\n\n\nWe are currently testing two highly requested webhook events in private beta:\n * cg.coin.price.updated [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fc&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hFqjsB2&]: Triggers when a specific coin crosses a target price threshold or exhibits highly volatile movement.\n   \n * cg.coin.new.listed [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fF&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=ha5fdEo&]: Get instant alerts the moment a brand-new token finishes indexing and goes live on CoinGecko.\n   \n\nJoin the early access waitlist to be the first to test these powerful webhook events.\n\n\n\nJoin Early Access Waitlist [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fr&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=h0ZXF5&]\n\n\nReady to Receive Instant Crypto Notifications?\n\n\nYou can easily create and test Webhooks directly in the developer dashboard by navigating to theWebhook page [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fP&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=h4iYdLS&]from the side panel. Read ourstep-by-step guide [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7f2&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hdrV0pl&]for more detailed guidance.\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/bb6b7f0d-7997-4017-828b-aba58775eb43.gif]\n\nCrypto Webhooks are exclusively available to paid API subscribers (Analyst and above). Upgrade your API plan to unlock the full data delivery suite, including Webhook endpoints, WebSocket streams, and exclusive REST API endpoints.\n\n\n\n[https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/901ea5bd-1eca-4db5-a404-9ceccb19412e.png]\n\n\nUpgrade to a Paid Plan [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fC&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hPPydQB&]\n\n\nLet Us Know Your Data Needs\n\nWe are expanding our Webhook capabilities and want to hear from you.Share your use cases and tell us exactly what webhook events you want to see next [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7f4&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hQAyppB&].\n\n\n\n\nNeed help? Submit a ticket here [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fN&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hCEv40n&].\n\n\n\n\nTrack Crypto Prices 24/7\n\n\n\n\nDownload the CoinGecko Mobile App on Google Play [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/79d6eb48-7e58-4e1d-9b01-9589db04c4d4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fJ&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hpo20KX&]\n\n\nDownload the CoinGecko Mobile App on App Store [https://multimedia.newsletter.coingecko.com/coingecko-h/photos/43eb23e6-19e2-4d3d-94b3-c1b660bb94c3.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fO&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=haFVPzy&]\n\n\n\n\n\nVisit our Twitter page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/twitter4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fR&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hcmAQEV&]\n\nVisit our Instagram page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/instagram4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fl&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hyPh3eT&]\n\nVisit our YouTube page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/youtube4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fM&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hdR1y7A&]\n\nVisit our Telegram page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/telegram4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fI&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hFtH7C&]\n\nVisit our Facebook page [https://us-as.gr-cdn.com/images/common/templates/messages/v2/social/facebook4.png] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fK&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hF0UPcb&]\nCoinGecko [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fA&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hyfOCYE&]• [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fX&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hplVcfe&]CoinGecko API [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fB&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hp6H4zs&]• [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fj&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hNhJFjn&]GeckoTerminal DEX Tracker [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fw&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=h4TfaVk&]• [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fZ&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hdZf3WZ&]Store [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fU&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hsNMrEB&]\nTerms of Service [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fk&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hhCNFIa&] [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fm&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hQZEQP1&]• [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fb&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hC4inG1&]Privacy Policy [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/email_marketing_click.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&lc=7fo&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hsQQrHh&]\n\n\n\n\nYou may unsubscribe [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/unsubscribe.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&m=dYF&mc=0&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hyyMsta&] or change your contact details [https://newsletter.coingecko.com/change_details.html?x=a62e&co=K7Zy&m=dYF&s=T0i3&u=p&z=hQPSPkK&] at any time.\n','incoming-complaint','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('afb2fe8b-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dear CoinGecko API,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"⚡️NEW: Instant Webhooks Notifications\".\n\nYour reference ID is #d69e6b3d. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('afbb3a9b-6633-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7','d69e6b3d-662d-11f1-bb83-601031c340f7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Manish is waiting for your response\n        \nHi Yashica, I’d like to join your professional network\n\nManish Singh\n--\nLucknow\n213 connections in common\nSee all connections in common:https://www.linkedin.com/comm/search/results/people/?facetNetwork=%5B%22F%22%5D&facetConnectionOf=%5B%22ADoAAF1LwyQBnUWm3vqKHu5PfGKBNaI80P18QWA%22%5D&origin=SHARED_CONNECTIONS_CANNED_SEARCH&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_m2m_invite_single_01%3BkjuLh8g2R7%2BhMYB6mIrvvg%3D%3D&midToken=AQG-BFco0wt-tA&midSig=2XSkmZgd7w-Ig1&trk=eml-email_m2m_invite_single_01-connections~in~common~text-0-view~connections&trkEmail=eml-email_m2m_invite_single_01-connections~in~common~text-0-view~connections-null-icq8ji~mq9mfd8x~e1-null-null&eid=icq8ji-mq9mfd8x-e1&ot