-based hiring and identify talent more effectively.\n\n💡 Track 2: Ideathon\n\nFor Designers, Product Builders, Business Minds & Innovators\n\nNo coding required. Package your sharpest ideas into a simple presentation and\nsolve challenges across:\n\n * AI Systems & Workflow Innovation\n * AI Growth, UX & Ecosystem Strategy\n * Everyday AI Innovation\n\nBring fresh thinking to how hiring, talent discovery, and AI-powered experiences\ncan evolve.\n\n📢 Track 3: Create The Buzz – AI Challenge\n\nFor Creators, Storytellers & Community Builders\n\nCreate original public content around AI, innovation, productivity, hiring, and\nthe future of work.\n\nShare your perspective, start conversations, and help inspire the next\ngeneration of builders.\n\n💼 EXCLUSIVE HIRING PRIVILEGE\n\nYou are also eligible to be a part of the INDIA RUNS hiring challenge where top\nperformers of each track get exclusive privilege to have a face-to-face\ninterview with the team for joining the team.\n\n \n\n\nWHAT YOU NEED TO DO RIGHT NOW\n\n✔ Log in to your dashboard ✔ Explore the challenge tracks and problem statements\n✔ Choose your preferred track ✔ Form your team (optional) ✔ Start building your\nsolution\n\nVISIT YOUR DASHBOARD  ➔\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Findia_runs%2Fdashboard%2Froadmap%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage/1/0108019ebbd63dd0-877cd1b9-04eb-49ad-af79-82238cda9f1f-000000/hOpQyll_V8JguJl4xcQNZAjH1LQ=258]\n\nThe future of hiring won\'t be built by outdated systems. It will be built by\npeople like you.\n\nLet\'s bring your best ideas to life.\n\nBest Regards,\nTeam Hack2skill × Redrob\n#IndiaRuns\n\nThis message was sent to registered participants of the INDIA RUNS Innovation\nChallenge. All rights reserved © 2026.\n\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/I0/0108019ebbd63dd0-877cd1b9-04eb-49ad-af79-82238cda9f1f-000000/NdH0yt1NkVB4PMb9_vpO8vRsHAg=258]\n\n \n\n \n\nFacebook\n[https://h2svision.github.