-26 07:59:02',NULL,NULL,NULL),('ddcaa313-88c7-11f1-9c30-2bf3437377fb','e754e5ff-6703-11f1-a09a-8107a00d61c0','Re: Join the WhatsApp channel','loharyashica@gmail.com','no-reply@unstop.news',NULL,'Dear Team Unstop,\n\nWe have received your ticket regarding: \"Join the WhatsApp channel\".\n\nYour reference ID is #e754e5ff. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','OUTGOING',NULL,'2026-07-26 07:59:02',NULL,NULL,NULL),('e7256775-6703-11f1-a09a-8107a00d61c0','e723c4e3-6703-11f1-a09a-8107a00d61c0',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,' \n\nLive Session: We are Live Right Now!\n\nINDIA RUNS Hiring Challenge\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/banner%20(2).png]\nhttps://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Findia_runs%2Fdashboard%2Finteractions%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage/1/0108019ebc4b9262-db7536cb-d80c-494e-96e5-eb8e540cd6a2-000000/I29-C3ZBpIwnAcuiAw6gLTnJ9-I=258\n\nHey Yashica Lohar,\n\n🔴 WE ARE LIVE NOW — JOIN THE SESSION IMMEDIATELY\n\nWhen you are looking for your dream job, your resume needs to show exactly what\nyou are capable of. The good news? You can now use AI as your personal career\ncoach to build a resume that gets you noticed instantly.\n\nAs a part of the INDIA RUNS\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Findia_runs%2Fdashboard%2Finteractions%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage/2/0108019ebc4b9262-db7536cb-d80c-494e-96e5-eb8e540cd6a2-000000/VkkpntCe4SSYpmY95DQb1V-i7hI=258]\nmovement, our exclusive masterclass has officially begun. The screen is live\nright now to show you how to easily level up your resume using smart AI tools!\n\n👉 CLICK HERE TO ENTER THE LIVE STREAM ROOM NOW 👈\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Findia_runs%2Fdashboard%2Finteractions%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage/3/0108019ebc4b9262-db7536cb-d80c-494e-96e5-eb8e540cd6a2-000000/bH6W5bCMRiXhbl8uNfEAmKDr404=258]\n\n🚨 STREAM ACCESS METRICS:\n\nSession: 🔴 Happening Right Now Topic: How to use AI to make your resume stand\nout! Access: Unlocked for all registered INDIA RUNS accounts\n\n💡 What we are covering inside:\n * The AI Resume Upgrade: How to use tools like Redrob AI to turn basic bullet\n   points into high-impact sentences that highlight your actual skills.\n * Matching the Perfect Job: Simple prompts to help you align your resume\n   perfectly with any job description you are targeting.\n * Showcasing Your Projects: How to talk about hands-on projects (like your\n   INDIA RUNS challenge submission) so hiring managers see your value on day\n   one.\n\nWhether you are applying for your first role or sharpening your current profile,\nthis session gives you practical, easy-to-use tips to build a standout career\nportfolio.\n\nThe audience has already assembled and the screen share is running. Do not miss\nout — grab your spot right now!\n\nCLICK HERE TO ACCESS THE LIVE WEBINAR ➔\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fhack2skill.com%2Fevent%2Findia_runs%2Fdashboard%2Finteractions%3Futm_source=hack2skill%26utm_medium=homepage/4/0108019ebc4b9262-db7536cb-d80c-494e-96e5-eb8e540cd6a2-000000/A9z6Yzw9SF5h-dwV5_LjIe1xA_c=258]\n\n \n\nBest Regards,\nTeam Hack2skill\n#IndiaRuns\n\nThis operational message was sent to registered profiles of the INDIA RUNS\ncommunity. All rights reserved © 2026.\n\n[https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/I0/0108019ebc4b9262-db7536cb-d80c-494e-96e5-eb8e540cd6a2-000000/brRnBeaf7pwcViPaxHsjza1Ceok=258]\n\n \n\n \n\nFacebook\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_facebook.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-southeast-2.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fhack2skill%2F/1/0108019ebc4b9262-db7536cb-d80c-494e-96e5-eb8e540cd6a2-000000/j_le3fvvxPPjXxWAXEJSQ3ua8x8=258\nTwitter\n[https://h2svision.github.io/publicAssets/vision/h2s_twitter.png]https://9hdppg0c.r.ap-south