~~/AAQRxRA~/WYtjoa7I92iFbQm-bIfZ8tFbM-2kEYm_3THdepCGHc_kHtYIT78BADKVEIA2xiuhF2AA0mJujjn3lv-RnT3eIcrSK16Nw5MhZe7tmYUoFjhWvEOwAEFV-00ZDFYcAEkB5Q-8I-PzJPJ6N4l20I3EMaDiCAJ_tzUYpED3sVeLjM3IGKyicbFfoV1wzpdUJ7N4myO4fdlLKu3aCwdeHV5-A73HTJkbc8jQ8O5zIAiKA0_2gXwj48_g2qiRYzF-7yRS_wFffnYxXxyxUiFLyWgai7M0Iqw0OOV1sFTCUZrcuGqisR55EJfiBS7I99dolbBE]\n   to safeguard against the negative consequences of AI technology\n * Develop an AI strategy and incorporate new tools into your workflow\n\nExplore 150+ GenAI courses\n[https://link.coursera.org/f/a/QTC_MTDsYwdgrxEEP5whFg~~/AAQRxRA~/rfxPsmtQmLxiP5oBupgJ9z2IobFfCejfZIeFU0J4P0dmIdUpz0jguhq6ztxbdWyy5Sg5oQKkwTSDYJ4zT_IvrNeRDIwlD3ZlSMvw4202cTdrKMH8RY-ggLw6UUl8Mpz8l25v2wmnm70Sx_eF71uZoY-hZm2Qlii2CoxjJPuvB-Rqsl4Rcc3JdKaPgweXrS4Wf8KuIJ1K_mZVqDH5oehbSqMC218vUOSi91yJopeg4Xt5keIRz7fd0wBcUidz4JMfCoo4GkyL6STzg7xSOzacrwen7VS3FFl_yxxoCnjXiFAVNpNaJ8d74DNvo6U28HwG]\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\nWHERE TO BEGIN\n\n\n\nFor a beginner-friendly crash course, try Google Cloud’s Introduction to\nGenerative AI\n[https://link.coursera.org/f/a/2cYUsC1TkQxCpN9DlrXYoA~~/AAQRxRA~/8JGF3R6NCYXhXA4gw_IqAbOgb8FP2_ZoB22lZj9yszxU2QyWmOsgf0BVff-cLM8FC079xwPeH-2PRDclZpCWQhMRvlCrcfsH4FzfT8BwcRnzRVWeR0xI6nhvV7qSpXqHB9tQldTc_Yi0EGjY4FTDhpxpRRP4qcYI9_K-tp-EXyAK6IDuGppRkNhp7KbAAkZJa2dYlayYMZuzPLJ85N1uij9grQe-hNP7TiCbX7ICZI9inVS1Sq0UZ84v0Hl8VFQ-3nP0SLxFSkSA0a-CdMGAV_y3N8JEbVIoGH_tiuLY2ZBIdC4t5hRP-Ust9vzDE2k54boFJijeSt4yEmIEso2BLQ~~].\nIn one hour, you’ll learn what generative AI is, how it works, and tools you can\nuse to build your own Gen AI apps.\n\nReady to deepen your skills? Here are some more popular AI courses:\n\n\n\n[https://d3njjcbhbojbot.cloudfront.net/api/utilities/v1/imageproxy/https://coursera-misc.s3.amazonaws.com/mailspin/prod/07_25_2023_20_56_27_Screenshot_2023-07-25_at_1.55.47_PM.png?w=120&border=1,E5E7E8&border-radius=6,6,6,6&border-radius-inner=6,6,6,6&dpr=2]\nhttps://link.coursera.org/f/a/LRlVNVqIyD