ontinues!\".\n\nYour reference ID is #e754e5ff. This issue has been logged and is currently under review by our team.','approved-draft-placeholder','INCOMING',NULL,'2026-06-21 16:52:16',NULL,NULL,NULL),('M-001-DRAFT','TICK-TEST-001','AI Draft','system@mailengine.com','furious.customer@gmail.com',NULL,'Dear customer, we received your complaint about the charge. We will check with finance.',NULL,'INTERNAL',NULL,'2026-07-27 15:52:59',NULL,NULL,NULL),('M-001-IN','TICK-TEST-001','UNAUTHORIZED CHARGE ON MY CREDIT CARD!!!','furious.customer@gmail.com','support@mailengine.com',NULL,'You double charged my account $99 today! This is unacceptable and absolute fraud. I want an immediate refund right now or I am calling my bank and reporting your company!',NULL,'INCOMING','2026-07-27 15:49:30','2026-07-27 15:49:30',NULL,NULL,NULL),('M-001-OUT','TICK-TEST-001','Re: UNAUTHORIZED CHARGE ON MY CREDIT CARD!!!','support@mailengine.com','furious.customer@gmail.com',NULL,'Dear Customer, We apologize for the double charge error. I have processed a full $99 refund to your card immediately. It will reflect in 3-5 business days.',NULL,'OUTGOING','2026-07-27 15:49:30','2026-07-27 15:49:30',NULL,NULL,NULL),('M-002-DRAFT','TICK-TEST-002','AI Draft','system@mailengine.com','alex.tech@gmail.com',NULL,'Please try clearing your browser cookies and logging in again.',NULL,'INTERNAL',NULL,'2026-07-27 15:53:03',NULL,NULL,NULL),('M-002-IN','TICK-TEST-002','Cannot login to my dashboard - password reset broken','alex.tech@gmail.com','support@mailengine.com',NULL,'Hi, I have been trying to reset my password for two hours. The link sent to my email keeps giving a 404 expired error. Please help me access my account as I have work pending.',NULL,'INCOMING','2026-07-27 15:49:39','2026-07-27 15:49:39',NULL,NULL,NULL),('M-002-OUT','TICK-TEST-002','Re: Cannot login to my dashboard','support@mailengine.com','alex.tech@gmail.com',NULL,'Hi Alex, I have generated a fresh temporary login link for your profile. Please click here to reset your credentials.',NULL,'OUTGOING','2026-07-27 15:49:39','2026-07-27 15:49:39',NULL,NULL,NULL),('M-003-IN','TICK-TEST-003','Question about export format options','sarah.ops@company.org','support@mailengine.com',NULL,'Hello team, does MailEngine support exporting ticket analytics to CSV or JSON formats? If so, where can I find that option in the dashboard settings?',NULL,'INCOMING','2026-07-27 15:49:45','2026-07-27 15:49:45',NULL,NULL,NULL),('M-003-OUT','TICK-TEST-003','Re: Question about export format options','support@mailengine.com','sarah.ops@company.org',NULL,'Hello Sarah, Yes, you can export reports in CSV format from the Settings > Data Export tab. JSON export will be released in the upcoming update.',NULL,'OUTGOING','2026-07-27 15:49:45','2026-07-27 15:49:45',NULL,NULL,NULL),('M-004-IN','TICK-TEST-004','Great experience with customer support!','david.m@gmail.com','support@mailengine.com',NULL,'I just wanted to say thank you so much for fixing my issue so quickly today. Excellent service and very fast turnaround time. Keep up the good work!',NULL,'INCOMING','2026-07-27 15:49:52','2026-07-27 15:49:52',NULL,NULL,NULL),('M-004-OUT','TICK-TEST-004','Re: Great experience with customer support!','support@mailengine.com','david.m@gmail.com',NULL,'Hi David, Thank you so much for the kind feedback! We are thrilled to hear we could help.',NULL,'OUTGOING','2026-07-27 15:49:52','2026-07-27 15:49:52',NULL,NULL,NULL),('M-005-IN','TICK-TEST-005','System crashed and wiped active session settings','dev.lead@enterprise.com','support@mailengine.com',NULL,'Your application crashed during our team sync meeting and lost our unsaved configuration data. This is a severe production bug causing major downtime for our workflow.',NULL,'INCOMING','2026-07-27 15:50:03','2026-07-27 15:50:03',NULL,NULL,NULL),('M-005-OUT','TICK-TEST-005','Re: System crashed and wiped active session settings','support@mailengine.com','dev.lead@enterprise.com',NULL,'Hello, Our engineering team is inspecting system logs to recover lost session data. We sincerely apologize for this outage.',NULL,'OUTGOING','2026-07-27 15:50:03','2026-07-27 15:50:03',NULL,NULL,NULL);
